cts Held in Attack Plot', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Europe', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turkey: 10 Suspects Held in Attack Plot', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-01T01:15:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sebnem Arsu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sebnem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arsu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed86f117-af72-5c64-97fd-f7ebade1d69b', 'word_count': 73, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed86f117-af72-5c64-97fd-f7ebade1d69b'}, {'abstract': 'Here is a slide show of photographs from the New York region in the past week. Subjects include a Russian church revived, a debutante ball and snow, snow, snow.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2010/12/31/the-week-in-pictures-for-dec-31/', 'snippet': 'Here is a slide show of photographs from the New York region in the past week. Subjects include a Russian church revived, a debutante ball and snow, snow, snow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here is a slide show of photographs from the New York region in the past week. Subjects include a Russian church revived, a debutante ball and snow, snow, snow.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Week in Pictures for Dec. 31', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-01T01:19:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organizati