urement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Beijing’s drive to extend its military and territorial reach is making America’s close allies in the region nervous and raising legitimate questions about American diplomacy and future military procurement. The commander of America’s Pacific forces recently revealed that China could soon deploy a ballistic missile capable of threatening American aircraft carriers in the region. ', 'print_section': 'WK', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China’s Naval Ambitions', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'China’s Naval Ambitions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Missiles and Missile Defense Systems', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-01T22:14:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/44bbd1ea-e58b-5d19-838b-8e83b014c3c2', 'word_count': 417, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44bbd1ea-e58b-5d19-838b-8e83b014c3c2'}, {'abstract': 'Representative Peter King of New York is no stranger to bluster, but his sweeping slur on Muslim citizens is unacceptable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/02/opinion/02sun3.html', 'snippet': 'Representative Peter King of New York is no stranger to bluster, but his sweeping slur on Muslim citizens is unacceptable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is disturbing to listen to Representative Peter King, the incoming chairman of the Homeland Security Committee. He has announced plans to hold a hearing next month into what he calls the “radicalization of the American Muslim community.” Mr. King, a New York Republican, is no stranger to bluster, but his sweeping slur on Muslim citizens is unacceptable. ', 'print_section': 'WK', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Homeland Blather', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Homeland Blather', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'King, Peter T', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslim-Americans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Islam', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-01T22:15:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e91a6e86-9804-5e36-83cd-d88d9e503475', 'word_count': 319, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e91a6e86-9804-5e36-83cd-d88d9e503475'}, {'abstract': 'One-of-a-kind weirdness, a collection of shoes and flowers, has blossomed in this 12.7-acre park that boasts a colorful history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/02/us/02bcintel.html', 'snippet': 'One-of-a-kind weirdness, a collection of shoes and flowers, has blossomed in this 12.7-acre park that boasts a colorful history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One-of-a-kind weirdness, a collection of shoes and flowers, has blossomed in this 12.7-acre park that boasts a colorful history, and picturesque Victorians on its perimeter. The Shoe Garden sprouted a decade ago and is still charming residents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/02/us/02BCINTEL1/02BCINTEL1-jumbo.jpg', '