fastest growing costs of city life, and in 2010, no mode in New York City seemed immune.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/03/nyregion/03cost.html', 'snippet': 'Transportation has become one of the fastest growing costs of city life, and in 2010, no mode in New York City seemed immune.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Subways? $104 a month. Bridge tolls? Going up. Gas? Don’t even ask. It can be enough to make a New Yorker yearn for a horse-and-buggy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/03/nyregion/03SUBCOST1/03SUBCOST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/03/nyregion/03SUBCOST1/03SUBCOST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/03/nyregion/03SUBCOST1/03SUBCOST1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/03/nyregion/03SUBCOST1/03SUBCOST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/03/nyregion/03SUBCOST1/03SUBCOST1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'By Car, Train or Buggy, Trips to the A.T.M. Will Rise', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'By Car, Train or Buggy, More Trips to the A.T.M.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transit Systems', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inflation (Economics)', 