leading.html', 'snippet': 'If you’re the coach of one of the dozen N.F.L. teams to make the playoffs, congratulations. If not, remember to pick your resume up off the printer before you leave the building.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The day after the N.F.L. regular season ends is a day littered with the carcasses of teams who had their playoff dreams ruined. The coaches who haven’t already been fired get called into those uncomfortable meetings with their bosses. (“No, Mr. Holmgren, losing 41-9 to Pittsburgh did not reflect well on me.”) Jim Harbaugh’s voice mail box explodes. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/04/sports/04leading/04leading-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/04/sports/04leading/04leading-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/04/sports/04leading/04leading-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 712, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/04/sports/04leading/04leading-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/04/sports/04leading/04leading-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'N.F.L. Job Insecurity', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'N.F.L. Job Insecurity', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Childress, Brad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indianapolis Colts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oakland Raid