: 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/03/more-on-the-twiblings/', 'snippet': 'The magazine article’s author responds to questions about surrogacy, egg donation and what makes a parent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fourteen years ago, when I first wrote on the subject of egg donation for The New York Times Magazine, I visited a woman who was one of the first “brokers” in the country to match donors and prospective parents. We sat in her sunny California garden (all new things start in L.A.) and paged through books of donor profiles — complete with their health histories, lists of likes and dislikes and smiling photos of themselves and, often, their children.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More on the ‘Twiblings’', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surrogate Motherhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-03T17:08:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Belkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6e5dd7a-b722-52d4-803f-f0d480b9899a', 'word_count': 1827, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6e5dd7a-b722-52d4-803f-f0d480b9899a'}, {'abstract': 'Their record says they are the worst playoff team in N.F.L. history, but the Seahawks bring some charm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/04/sports/football/04fastforward.html', 'snippet': 'Their record says they are the worst playoff team in N.F.L. history, but the Seahawks bring some charm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bill Parcells used to dismiss the excuses and analysis and sum up the entire N.F.L. with a simple, biting adage: you are what your record says you are. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'prin