 the album of the same name will be for sale on May 23rd.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/03/lady-gaga-announces-release-date-of-new-album/', 'snippet': 'In her first Tweet of 2011 Lady Gaga announced that her new single “Born this Way,’’ will be available in stores on February 13 and the album of the same name will be for sale on May 23rd.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ever the provocateur, Lady Gaga posted a picture of herself on her Web site, dancing with her blonde hair flying in the wind and wearing nothing but a “Born This Way” jacket. The image follows her first Twitter posting of 2011 in which she announced that her new single, “Born This Way,’’ will be available in stores on Feb. 13 and that the album of the same name will be for sale on May 23. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lady Gaga Announces Release Date of New Album', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lady Gaga', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-03T18:05:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/8303adbf-2df5-587d-b017-2683782fbcd8', 'word_count': 128, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8303adbf-2df5-587d-b017-2683782fbcd8'}, {'abstract': 'In a recent essay for the Book Review, I wrote about the art of the very long sentence. Many readers sent me their own favorite examples.', 'web_url': 'https://papercuts.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/03/the-art-of-the-very-long-sentence/', 'snippet': 'In a recent essay for the Book Review, I wrote about the art of the very long sentence. Many readers sent me their own favorite examples.', 'l