'snippet': 'Jack Morris’s candidacy for the National Baseball Hall of Fame provokes plenty of vitriol, but he started big games for a reason.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most Baseball Hall of Fame voters think Jack Morris deserves a plaque in Cooperstown. That is not enough to get Morris into the Hall of Fame \x97 he had 52 percent of the vote last year, and candidates need 75 \x97 but it is significant. And it infuriates a lot of people.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/04/sports/yKEPNER/yKEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 892, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/04/sports/yKEPNER/yKEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/04/sports/yKEPNER/yKEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Case for Morris: Big Moments Count', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Case for Morris: Big Moments Count', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baseball Hall of Fame', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Twins', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morris, Jack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toronto Blue Jays', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-03T18:38:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler K