nd “Blue Valentine” didn’t make the cut.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/04/the-town-breaks-into-producers-list/', 'snippet': 'Ben Affleck’s bank-heist movie was the surprise addition to the Producers Guild of America Top 10, while indie darlings “Winter’s Bone” and “Blue Valentine” didn’t make the cut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ben Affleck and “The Town” grabbed one of 10 best-picture slots from the Producers Guild of America, which announced its nominees on Tuesday morning, possibly advancing the Boston drama’s chances to make the big list at the Oscars. The remainder of the nominees were the expected names: “The Social Network,” “Inception,” “Black Swan,” “True Grit,” “The Kids Are All Right,” “The Fighter,” “The King’s Speech” and “Toy Story 3.” Left off the feature list were indie wild cards like “Winter’s Bone” and “Blue Valentine,” both of which have drawn praise for their performances. (The producers’ guild does not nominate actors; its awards go only to the producers of each film.) ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Town’ Breaks Into Producers’ List', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AFFLECK, BEN', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rudin, Scott', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Producers Guild of America', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-04T15:44:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b301f4a-c308-5d87-ab22-ecc8a52c6bec', 'word_count': 330, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b301f4a-c308-5d87-ab22-ecc8a52c6bec'}, {'abstract': 'Despite lingering effects of the recession, more people visited New York City in 2010 than in any previous year, according to an estimate announced by Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/04/tourism-hit-record-high-in-2010/', 'snippet': 'Despite lingering effects of the recession, more people visited New York City in 2010 than in any previous year, according to an estimate announced by Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite the lingering effects of the recession, more people visited New York City in 2010 than in any previous year, according to an estimate announced by Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '48.7 Million: That’s a Lot of Tourists', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'HOTELS AND MOTELS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-04T15:45:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick McGeehan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGeehan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/de5dca28-3637-586f-bffa-bf864ded5040', 'word_count': 316, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de5dca28-3637-586f-bffa-bf864ded5040'}, {'abstract': 'Capt. Owen Honors, who produced a series of coarse videos, was removed from command of the Enterprise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/05/us/05military.html', 'snippet': 'Capt. Owen Honors, who produced a series of coarse videos, was removed from command of the Enterprise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON \x97 The United States Navy removed the commanding officer of the aircraft carrier Enterprise on Tuesday, citing his “profound lack of good judgment” for creating and starring in a series of coarse and sexually explicit onboard videos several years ago that were meant as entertainment for the ship’s crew.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/04/us/MILITARY-1/MILITARY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/04/us/MILITARY-1/MILITARY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/04/us/MILITARY-1/MILITARY-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/04/us/MILITARY-1/MILITARY-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/04/us/MILITARY-1/MILITARY-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Aircraft Carrier Captain Is Removed Over His Role in Coarse Videos', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Aircraft Carrier Captain Is Removed Over His Role in Coarse Videos', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Navy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-04T15:55:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Bumil