imes.com/2011/01/05/sports/ncaabasketball/05araton.html', 'snippet': 'The Red Storm is 3-0 in the Big East after beating Georgetown on Monday, recalling the days before the league was bloated and St. John’s was a force in college basketball, if not a true powerhouse.', 'lead_paragraph': ' It was plenty loud inside Madison Square Garden on Monday night when Dwight Hardy of St. John’s electrified the 8,897 fans in the final seconds of a 1-point game with a stutter-step move that could have shaken the common cold. Even with more than 10,000 seats empty, the building sounded a little like 1985.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05araton/05araton-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05araton/05araton-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05araton/05araton-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 770, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05araton/05araton-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05araton/05araton-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'St. John’s Gives Fans Something to Remember', 'kicker': 'On Basketball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'St. John’s Gives Fans Something to Remember', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Madison Square Garden', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '