sday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/05/sports/baseball/05kepner.html', 'snippet': 'Unproven steroid suspicions about Jeff Bagwell are affecting the Baseball Hall of Fame vote on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was just a casual conversation one day in the weight room between Jeff Bagwell and Morgan Ensberg, the corner infielders for the Houston Astros. Bagwell was trying to bench-press his usual 300 pounds, and he mentioned to Ensberg that some players around the game had gotten huge by using steroids.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05kepner/05kepner-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05kepner/05kepner-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05kepner/05kepner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 578, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05kepner/05kepner-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/05/sports/05kepner/05kepner-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Voting for Hall Shouldn’t Be Guessing Who’s Guilty', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Based on Steroid Suspicions, Doors to Hall Are Closed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Puckett, Kirby', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baseball Hall of Fame', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'},