'word_count': 201, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae2f5af2-9bd6-53d5-85f6-f74323c2a05f'}, {'abstract': 'The 1,300 people who attended the Christmas Masses at Our Lady of Lourdes Church in Massapequa Park, N.Y., were urged to get vaccinated for hepatitis A.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/05/nyregion/05communion.html', 'snippet': 'The 1,300 people who attended the Christmas Masses at Our Lady of Lourdes Church in Massapequa Park, N.Y., were urged to get vaccinated for hepatitis A.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MASSAPEQUA PARK, N.Y. \x97 It was not the first time a health scare had infiltrated the sanctuary of a Roman Catholic church. The bodily contact in certain church rituals has made some people wary of touching hands or sharing chalices of altar wine during every public health emergency, real or imagined, of the last few decades. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/05/nyregion/COMMUNION/COMMUNION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Worry of Tainted Wafers Scares Church', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Worry of Tainted Wafers Scares Church', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nassau County (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hepatitis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-05T02:44:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Vitello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vitello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'or