ber of the local branch of Al Qaeda.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/06/world/africa/06morocco.html', 'snippet': 'Authorities arrested 27 people accused of operating a terror cell in the Western Sahara led by a member of the local branch of Al Qaeda.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Moroccan government arrested 27 people accused of operating a terrorist cell in Western Sahara led by a member of the local branch of Al Qaeda, officials said Wednesday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morocco Says It Foiled Terror Cell in Sahara', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Morocco Arrests 27 Said to Run Terrorist Cell in Western Sahara', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Morocco', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Western Sahara', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-05T17:23:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman and Souad Mekhennet', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Souad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mekhennet', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e09dac2e-833f-5f9b-aa8d-23cee9780520', 'word_count': 482, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e09dac2e-833f-5f9b-aa8d-23cee9780520'}, {'abstract': 'Private schools are not obligated, and often not set up, to handle children having trouble keeping up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/06/nyregion/06private.htm