tter, rare instances of natural beauty in a desolate landscape known more for its gleaming casinos. For years, hikers and rock climbers have flocked to Red Rock Canyon for the easily accessible climbs. History seekers come to look at the patch of land where Indian tribes roamed as far back as the 10th century. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/06/us/ROCKS-1/ROCKS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 303, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/06/us/ROCKS-1/ROCKS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 303}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/06/us/ROCKS-1/ROCKS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 517, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/06/us/ROCKS-1/ROCKS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/06/us/ROCKS-1/ROCKS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Red Rocks of Nevada Smudged by Less Colorful Graffiti', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Nevada, a Millennium of Messages in Jeopardy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vandalism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nevada', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Graffiti', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wilderness Areas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock and Stone', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'History', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'p