 care for him, attended a school for children with behavioral issues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 10th grader at Public School 12 in the Bronx, a school for students with behavioral issues and special needs, had a reputation among his classmates as a bully. He had been in fights over the past year, picking on smaller students, classmates said, and had been so difficult to control at home lately, his mother said, that she had petitioned the courts for extra supervision and foster care. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/06/nyregion/STAB/STAB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Troubled Youth Gravely Injured in Stabbing Near School', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Troubled Youth Gravely Injured in Stabbing Near School', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-06T02:58:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liz Robbins and Mick Meenan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robbins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Mick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Meenan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa9965db-9a2e-5029-a19a-8493a3bbecb0', 'word_count': 593, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa9965db-9a2e-5029-a19a-8493a3bbecb0'}, {'abstract': 'The 112th Congress convened for the first time, with Republicans officially taking the helm of the House.', 'w