, 'snippet': 'The Jets assistant Mike Westhoff plans to address the team and go over the basics of the new playoff overtime rule.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — After some three decades spent on N.F.L. sidelines — almost exclusively with special teams — the Jets assistant Mike Westhoff still experiences the occasional first. On Saturday, he will confront the league’s new playoff overtime rule. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Jets Are Preparing for a Change in Overtime', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Westhoff, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-06T05:08:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Greg Bishop', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Greg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bishop', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/e7c906da-1eb9-5ae6-97ec-cfeb0c45cd03', 'word_count': 398, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7c906da-1eb9-5ae6-97ec-cfeb0c45cd03'}, {'abstract': 'Annotated video and transcript of Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s speech in Albany.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2011/01/05/nyregion/20110105-cuomo-state.html', 'snippet': 'Annotated video and transcript of Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s speech in Albany.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Annotated video and transcript of Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s speech in Albany.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Analyzing the State of the State Address', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocatio