https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/07/dining/07tipsy.html', 'snippet': 'Balance may or may not be the key to a happy life, but it’s definitely the foundation of a great drink.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Balance may or may not be the key to a happy life — I’ve seen plenty of full-throttle hedonists and incorrigible workaholics who are doing just fine — but it’s definitely the foundation of a great cocktail.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/07/dining/07tipsy-span/07tipsy-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/07/dining/07tipsy-span/07tipsy-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 351}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/07/dining/07tipsy-span/TIPSY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 761, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/07/dining/07tipsy-span/07tipsy-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/07/dining/07tipsy-span/07tipsy-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '3 Cocktails That Share an Exquisite Secret', 'kicker': 'The Tipsy Diaries', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '3 Cocktails That Share an Exquisite Secret', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocktails', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-06T17:15:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Frank Bruni', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Frank', 'middlenam