'uri': 'nyt://article/8630ab84-c0ae-550a-bfdf-dd94b4980a8e'}, {'abstract': 'Courts will be deciding the fate of MBIA, which claims some banks owe it money because they lied about the mortgages backing securities that MBIA insured.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/07/business/07norris.html', 'snippet': 'Courts will be deciding the fate of MBIA, which claims some banks owe it money because they lied about the mortgages backing securities that MBIA insured.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MBIA, an insurance company whose very existence is imperiled because it underestimated the risks involved in mortgage lending, says the banks owe it billions because they lied about the mortgages backing securities that MBIA insured. The insurer’s financial statements show it is solvent in large part because that money will be coming in.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/06/03/health/floyd-norris/floyd-norris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2010/06/03/health/floyd-norris/floyd-norris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'MBIA Fights Banks for Its Life', 'kicker': 'High & Low Finance', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'MBIA Fights Banks For Its Life', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MBIA Incorporated', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Insurance', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings and Rating Systems', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 6, 'major': '