rt to reduce the number of abortions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/07/nyregion/07abortion.html', 'snippet': 'The Catholic Archbishop of New York City and others said there should be an effort to reduce the number of abortions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Archbishop Timothy M. Dolan of New York joined other local religious leaders on Thursday in calling for a new effort to reduce the number of abortions in the city. The annual figure has averaged 90,000 in recent years, or about 40 percent of all pregnancies, twice the national rate.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/07/nyregion/ABORTION/ABORTION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Religious Leaders Call for New Efforts to Lower the City’s ‘Chilling’ Abortion Rate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clergy Urge Efforts to Lower the City’s Abortion Rate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dolan, Timothy M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Organization for Women', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T02:04:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Vitello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vitello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72d33fa2-ace9-5c31-9434-e2aab3feb81f', 'word_count':