iant career was ever so slightly sullied by a confounding three-week slump. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/07/sports/MANNINGsilo/MANNINGsilo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 512, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/07/sports/MANNINGsilo/MANNINGsilo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/07/sports/MANNINGsilo/MANNINGsilo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Slump, Manning’s Season Looks Up', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Manning Questions Have Been Answered', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indianapolis Colts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Peyton', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T02:21:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77c97382-0aa3-5a5a-93a6-739505d82230', 'word_count': 1379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77c97382-0aa3-5a5a-93a6-739505d82230'}, {'abstract': 'Behind the scenes at San Francisco City Hall, Mayor Gavin Newsom, former Mayor Willie L. Brown Jr. and Rose Pak played crucial roles in the selection of an interim mayor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/07/us/07bcmayor.html', 'snippet': 'Behind the scenes at San Francisco City Hall, Mayor Gavin Newsom, former Mayor Willie L. Brown Jr. and Rose Pak played crucial roles in the selection of an interim mayor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Sunday afternoon, former Mayor Willie L. Brown Jr. made an urgent call to Rose Pak, his longtime political ally and the powerful head of the Chinatown Chamber of Commerce. Word had trickled out that San Francisco’s Board of Supervisors had narrowed the list of interim candidates to replace Mayor Gavin Newsom, the lieutenant governor-elect. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/07/us/07BCMAYOR2_span/07BCMAYOR2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/07/us/07BCMAYOR2_span/07BCMAYOR2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Behind-the-Scenes Power Politics: The Making of a Mayor', 'kicker': 'The Bay Citizen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Behind-the-Scenes Power Politics: The Making of a Mayor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T02:22:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gerry Shih', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gerry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shih', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_mate