om Today’s Times: ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Early Word: Debt and Jobs', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T11:00:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Janie Lorber and Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Janie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lorber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fa80770-7b47-58d7-a458-1f1221e49906', 'word_count': 681, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fa80770-7b47-58d7-a458-1f1221e49906'}, {'abstract': 'The former Jets quarterback Joe Namath gives the current Jets some advice before their playoff game Saturday night.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/07/joe-namaths-advice-for-jets-against-colts/', 'snippet': 'The former Jets quarterback Joe Namath gives the current Jets some advice before their playoff game Saturday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joe Namath has had some experience beating the Colts in a big game. In this video, he talks about disrupting Peyton Manning, with blitzes and disguised coverages, and bothering his receivers, by jamming them at the line. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Joe Namath’s Advice for Jets Against Colts', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Namath, Joe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indianapo