t of President Obama’s four-year term.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/08/business/economy/08jobs.html', 'snippet': 'The rate of growth — 103,000 jobs in December — is an indication that the unemployment rate will likely remain high through the rest of President Obama’s four-year term.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The year 2010 ended on a disappointing note, as the economy added just 103,000 jobs in December, suggesting that economic deliverance will not arrive with a great pop in employment.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/08/business/economy/08jobs-span/08jobs-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/08/business/economy/08jobs-span/08jobs-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/08/business/economy/08jobs-span/08jobs-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/08/business/economy/08jobs-span/08jobs-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/08/business/economy/08jobs-span/08jobs-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Slow Job Growth Dims Expectation of Early Revival', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'SLOW JOB GROWTH\nDIMS EXPECTATION\nOF EARLY REVIVAL', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and 