to the Stars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/08/sports/hockey/08devils.html', 'snippet': 'With his team spiraling toward a record fall-off from last season, Devils General Manager Lou Lamoriello begins the rebuilding process by trading captain Jamie Langenbrunner to the Stars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Devils traded their captain, Jamie Langenbrunner, to the Dallas Stars for a conditional draft choice Friday morning, signaling the end of the Devils’ hopes for this season and the possible start of a series of rebuilding moves by the N.H.L.’s last-place club.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Devils Trade Langenbrunner to Dallas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'N.H.L. ROUNDUP; Devils Trade Langenbrunner to Dallas', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dallas Stars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lamoriello, Lou', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Langenbrunner, Jamie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Jersey Devils', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T17:44:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/20c58403-79a7-5ab9-b9f1-abc12c21ee09', 'word_count': 655, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20c58403-79a7-5ab9-b9f1-abc12c21ee09'}, {'abstract': 'A group that won an MTV competition will perform this summer.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/07/vail-dance-festival-taps-tv-for-talent