'uri': 'nyt://article/1439d9c0-75de-51e0-b240-3b2ea22e4476'}, {'abstract': 'Both companies are awaiting a ruling from the Delaware Chancery Court on Air Products’ challenge to the Airgas poison pill.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/01/07/air-products-extends-offer/', 'snippet': 'Both companies are awaiting a ruling from the Delaware Chancery Court on Air Products’ challenge to the Airgas poison pill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Air Products and Chemicals said on Friday that it had extended its tender offer for shares of Airgas to Feb. 4, from Jan. 14. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Air Products Extends Offer for Airgas', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Air Products and Chemicals Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Airgas Incorporated', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T21:22:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/3875e676-eacb-5343-853c-6d3570a9187d', 'word_count': 112, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3875e676-eacb-5343-853c-6d3570a9187d'}, {'abstract': '“The Films of Rita Hayworth” tracks the career of a star who represented good, clean censor-proof sex during World War II and, in postwar movies, a temptress.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/09/movies/homevideo/09kehr.html', 'snippet': '“The Films of Rita Hayworth” tracks the career of a star who represented good, clean censor-proof sex during World War II and, in postwar movies, a temptress.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN the early 1940s, as America prepared for war, Rita Hayworth led a revolution. With her co-conspirators Lana Turner (at MGM) and Betty Grable (at 20th Century Fox), Hayworth, who was just emerging as the first star created in-house at budget-minded Columbia Pictures, offered a new shape and shapeliness to Hollywood’s feminine ideal.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/09/arts/KEHR1/KEHR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/09/arts/KEHR1/KEHR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/09/arts/KEHR1/KEHR1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/09/arts/KEHR1/KEHR1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/09/arts/KEHR1/KEHR1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'That Postwar Shimmy-Shake', 'kicker': 'DVDs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'That Postwar Shimmy-Shake', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'DVD (Digital Versatile Disc)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hayworth, Rita', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T21:22:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '0', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'subsection_name': 'DVD', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Kehr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kehr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role':