 treat breast cancer has now reversed course, for now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A regional Medicare contractor that was planning to stop paying for use of the drug Avastin to treat breast cancer has reversed course.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Medicare Contractor Will Pay for Avastin During Appeal', 'kicker': 'Prescriptions', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Avastin (Drug)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Breasts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cancer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Genentech Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T21:27:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/bdb679e3-04d8-51b4-bf5f-b6f0cc3fc5eb', 'word_count': 360, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bdb679e3-04d8-51b4-bf5f-b6f0cc3fc5eb'}, {'abstract': 'If the Mets land Chris Young, their intellectually formidable pitching staff will include a Princeton man, a Phi Beta Kappa from Duke and the well-read R. A. Dickey.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/08/sports/baseball/08mets.html', 'snippet': 'If the Mets land Chris Young, their intellectually formidable pitching staff will include a Princeton man, a Phi Beta Kappa from Duke and the well-read R. A. Dickey.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The new Mets pitcher Chris Capuano graduated from Duke University in 2000 with a 3.86 grade point average, an impressive number he would happily take either as his G.P.A. or earned run average. A 2006 National League All-Star, he was also Phi Beta Kappa.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/08/sports/mets/mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/08/sports/mets/mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/08/sports/mets/mets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 579, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/08/sports/mets/mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/08/sports/mets/mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets Try to Be Brainy With Pitching Staff', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mets Try to Be Brainy With Pitching Staff', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Capuano, Chris', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Young, Chris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Phi Beta Kappa', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dickey, R A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T21:28:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastna