elations campaign in recent months has had its highs and lows.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Highs and Lows for Qatar', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup (Soccer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blatter, Sepp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Federation of Association Football (FIFA)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Qatar', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-07T22:41:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Marcus', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Marcus', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/1193b9fc-bbca-520f-9efd-807feb8b5ca7', 'word_count': 502, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1193b9fc-bbca-520f-9efd-807feb8b5ca7'}, {'abstract': 'The talk show host and Bravo executive exhibits uncurbed enthusiasm for his celebrity friends and his New York lifestyle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/09/fashion/09COHEN.html', 'snippet': 'The talk show host and Bravo executive exhibits uncurbed enthusiasm for his celebrity friends and his New York lifestyle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SOME people say hello when they run into a friend at a restaurant. For Andy Cohen, a Bravo executive and talk show host, hello would be boring. It would be flat. It would not reflect his oversize pleasure in the smallest of surprises, the magnitude of the serendipity, as he sees it.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'captio