, 'print_headline': 'Gates Packs Familiar List Of Issues For Beijing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gates, Robert M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-08T03:38:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Bumiller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bumiller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0527f20-64b3-57db-83be-ab4e4f05bce8', 'word_count': 741, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0527f20-64b3-57db-83be-ab4e4f05bce8'}, {'abstract': 'A new report from the Census Bureau reveals data about many vital things, including water, jazz and bowling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/08/us/08census.html', 'snippet': 'A new report from the Census Bureau reveals data about many vital things, including water, jazz and bowling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Forget that adage about death and taxes: since 2000, both the death rate and the tax rate in the United States have declined. But the number of individuals reporting income of $1 million or more rose to 392,000 in 2007 from 240,000 when the decade began. And who knew that most Americans of Armenian ancestry live in the West?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A U.S. Portrait, in Numbers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Portrait, In Numbers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Census', 'rank': 2,