epublican members of the House of Representatives.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/08/multimedia/10937_1_freshman_75x75.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/08/multimedia/10937_1_freshman_75x75.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Freshman Orientation', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oklahoma', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-08T21:41:29+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'Ben Werschkul', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Werschkul', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/3b1d34f6-c725-52e9-87dd-a8fc225d7aa9', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/3b1d34f6-c725-52e9-87dd-a8fc225d7aa9'}, {'abstract': 'Scores of new Republican lawmakers have arrived, tasked with annulling the ambitious Democratic policy agenda to put an immediate conservative imprint on Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/09/us/politics/09freshman.html', 'snippet': 'Scores of new Republican lawmakers have arrived, tasked with annulling the ambitious Democratic policy agenda to put an immediate conservative imprint on Washington.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON \x97 You’re new to town, and your dreams and plans are big as the Capitol rotunda. You will do all you can to repeal the new health care law. You will tame the budget deficit. You will make your mark, or at least a very large spe