e Communism in Czechoslovakia, died Saturday in Prague. He was 73.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/10/world/dienstbier-obit/dienstbier-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/10/world/dienstbier-obit/dienstbier-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/10/world/dienstbier-obit/dienstbier-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jiri Dienstbier, Czech Dissident, Is Dead at 73', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jiri Dienstbier, Czech Dissident, Is Dead at 73', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Czech Republic', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Havel, Vaclav', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of Czechoslovakia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dienstbier, Jiri', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-08T23:30:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Dempsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dempsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/c92bc22b-da48-5eac-8725-24e058e08238', 'word_count': 569, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c92bc22b-da48-5eac-8725-24e058e08238'}, {'abstract': 'It’s barely possible to overstate the significance of the King James Version of the Bible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/09/opinion/09sun3.html', 'snippet': 'It’s barely possible to overstate the significance of the King James Version of the Bible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometime in 1611, a new English Bible was published. It was the work of an almost impossibly learned team of men laboring since 1604 under royal mandate. Their purpose, they wrote, was not to make a new translation of the Bible but “to make a good one better, or out of many good ones, one principal good one.” What was published, 400 years ago, was indeed one principal good one: the King James Version of the Bible.', 'print_section': 'WK', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The King James Bible at 400', 'kicker': 'Editorial Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The King James Bible at 400', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bible', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'English Language', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tyndale, William', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coverdale, Miles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Translation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-08T23:32:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Verlyn Klinkenborg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Verlyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Klinkenborg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/75be6204-fed1-5d33-a5b9-dfcdc1f88780', 'word_count': 491, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75be6204-fed1-5d33-a5b9-dfcdc1f88780'}, {'abstr