e Seahawks rallied from a 10-point deficit to upset the defending champion Saints.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE \x97 The Seattle Seahawks spent most of the week being derided as the worst team ever to enter the N.F.L. playoffs. History will remember these postseason interlopers for perpetrating one of the game’s biggest upsets.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/09/sports/SUB-Y-JP-SEAHAWKS1/SUB-Y-JP-SEAHAWKS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 888, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/09/sports/SUB-Y-JP-SEAHAWKS1/SUB-Y-JP-SEAHAWKS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/09/sports/SUB-Y-JP-SEAHAWKS1/SUB-Y-JP-SEAHAWKS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Upset, Seahawks Hunger for More', 'kicker': 'Seahawks 41, Saints 36', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Seahawks Hunger for More\nAfter Shocking the Saints', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seattle Seahawks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Orleans Saints', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-09T01:37:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Branch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Branch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'orga