ww.nytimes.com/2011/01/10/opinion/10mon4.html', 'snippet': 'The fuss over last week’s small snowstorm wasn’t only, or even mostly, about snow. It was about the mayor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Mayor Michael Bloomberg went to red alert for the small snowstorm that swept into New York City on Friday, it was fairly evident that the fuss over snow removal wasn’t only, or even mostly, about snow. It was about the mayor.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mayor Bloomberg Shovels Out', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mayor Bloomberg Shovels Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-10T04:03:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/49eb83d3-0893-56fe-847e-511f115dc466', 'word_count': 395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49eb83d3-0893-56fe-847e-511f115dc466'}, {'abstract': 'As Congress dawdles on climate change, states and cities are taking actions. It is not enough, however. We need a national plan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/10/opinion/10mon3.html', 'snippet': 'As Congress dawdles on climate change, states and cities are taking actions. It is not enough, however. We need a national plan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Advocates of federal action to address climate change had little to cheer about in 2010. The prospects may be even grimmer this year, with nearly every important committee chair in the now Republican-controlled House dismissing the threat of global warming or the human contribution to it. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'pr