rathon for Pentagon: Seven Hours of Plays', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Shakespeare Theater Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-10T17:30:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/e029eb38-c0f1-5b88-8731-5d0ff040fc02', 'word_count': 195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e029eb38-c0f1-5b88-8731-5d0ff040fc02'}, {'abstract': 'A protege remembers the father of airline deregulation — and a dedicated enemy of the passive voice. The post has links to obituaries of Mr. Kahn, a PBS interview with him and a recent research paper dedicated to him.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/10/remembering-alfred-kahn/', 'snippet': 'A protege remembers the father of airline deregulation — and a dedicated enemy of the passive voice. The post has links to obituaries of Mr. Kahn, a PBS interview with him and a recent research paper dedicated to him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you missed Robert Frank’s tribute to Alfred Kahn — the father of airline deregulation, who died recently — I’d encourage you to read it. An excerpt:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Remembering Alfred Kahn', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': N