 large fossils of leaves, including elephant ear plants, in enormous blocks of shale.', 'web_url': 'https://scientistatwork.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/10/amid-the-shales-glimpses-of-an-ancient-forest/', 'snippet': 'A research team in Ethiopia has been finding large fossils of leaves, including elephant ear plants, in enormous blocks of shale.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bonnie F. Jacobs, a paleobotanist at Southern Methodist University, writes from Ethiopia, where she is studying fossils of ancient plant and animal life. The current field season in the Mush Valley of Ethiopia is financed by a grant to Ellen Currano of Miami University, Ohio, from the National Geographic Society’s Committee for Research and Exploration.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amid the Shales, Glimpses of an Ancient Forest', 'kicker': 'Scientist at Work', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forests and Forestry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paleontology', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shale', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ethiopia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-10T21:59:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bonnie F. Jacobs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bonnie', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Jacobs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a3621af-aa54-503a-ad12-f428417e5b53', 'word_count': 856, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a3621af-aa54-503a-ad12-f428417e5b53'}, {'abstract': 'The playwright Enda Walsh and the director John Tiffany will collaborate on the stage adaptation of the popular film.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/10/creative-team-announced-for-stage-musical-of-oscar-winning-once/', 'snippet': 'The playwright Enda Walsh and the director John Tiffany will collaborate on the stage adaptation of the popular film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Irish playwright Enda Walsh (“Penelope”) and the Scottish director John Tiffany (“Black Watch”) will collaborate on the stage adaptation of the film “Once” that is planned for a fall opening on Broadway, the producers announced on Monday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Creative Team Announced for Stage Musical of Oscar-Winning ‘Once’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-10T22:00:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/68e0c1fa-e00a-5cc8-ae74-859aa4d4384e', 'word_count': 138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68e0c1fa-e00a-5cc8-ae74-859aa4d4384e'}, {'abstract': 'Letter From Albany: The governor, the Assembly speaker and the Senate leader eat chicken and talk turkey.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/10/three-men-in-a-more-upscale-room/', 'snippet': 'Letter From Albany: The governor, the Assembly speaker and the Senate leader eat chicken and talk turkey.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY – Goodbye, three men in a room. Hello, three men in a mansion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Three Men in a More Upscale Room', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_da