Carolina.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Snow piled 4 inches in Atlanta, 11 inches in Tennessee and a foot in North Carolina.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/10/us/ATLANTA-slide-8IQH/ATLANTA-slide-8IQH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/10/us/ATLANTA-slide-8IQH/ATLANTA-slide-8IQH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/10/us/ATLANTA-slide-8IQH/ATLANTA-slide-8IQH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The South, Wreathed in White', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-11T02:58:12+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'U.S.', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/e86b6581-ebfb-5793-a379-5e23cb07dbe7', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/e86b6581-ebfb-5793-a379-5e23cb07dbe7'}, {'abstract': 'A forecast storm becomes more than just a weather event: it gets loaded with political and sociological significance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/11/nyregion/11winter.html', 'snippet': 'A forecast storm becomes more than just a weather event: it gets loaded with political and sociological significance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Time was, clouds gathered over the frigid city and released moisture that fell to the land not in liquid form, but in a semi-hardened state that the people called “snow.” The people waited for the snow to stop falling, and they worked to clear enough from the roads so as to access without interruption institutions of commerce, entertainment and worship. This period of snowfall was called “winter.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/11/nyregion/WINTER/WINTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/11/nyregion/WINTER/WINTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/11/nyregion/WINTER/WINTER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/11/nyregion/WINTER/WINTER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/11/nyregion/WINTER/WINTER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Flakes May Not Pile Up, but the Anxiety Will', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Flakes May Not Pile Up, But the Anxiety Will', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-11T02:59:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'ny