ith spring’s all-business envelope clutch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Another day, another iPad fashion app. And, so it seems, another designer case, with everyone from Armani to Zegna trying to get into the digital action. YSL\xa0first released the ChYc iPad case in the brand’s signature black and is now offering a fire-red version, which is perfectly in tune with spring’s all-business envelope clutch. It’s priced about the same as the midlevel Wi-Fi and 3G-enabled iPad, so be prepared to download $750 at your A.T.M. before skipping to a YSL boutique near you.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Go for Broke | YSL iPad Case', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-11T18:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd598c5b-22ad-5d16-9aa3-a3423538c887', 'word_count': 83, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd598c5b-22ad-5d16-9aa3-a3423538c887'}, {'abstract': '“Could you recommend a special resort setting in Puerto Rico or Tortola? Puerto Rico because it’s close and Tortola because that’s where we honeymooned.”', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/11/qa-puerto-rico-or-tortola-for-a-30th-anniversary/', 'snippet': '“Could you recommend a special resort setting in Puerto Rico or Tortola? Puerto Rico because it’s close and Tortola because that’s where we honeymooned.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'My husband and I will be celebrating our 30th wedding anniversary this February. Could you recommend a special resort setting in Puerto Rico or Tortola? Puerto Rico because it’s close and Tortola because that’s where we honeymooned. We are limited to the school break in February but do not want to stay at a resort overrun with children. Looking for a quiet beach/private pool, good food and wine. Any suggestions to help us mark this milestone? M. Rossi, Merrick, N.Y.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q&A: Puerto Rico or Tortola for a 30th Anniversary?', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Puerto Rico', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Vieques Island (Puerto Rico)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-11T18:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rusha Haljuci', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rusha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haljuci', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/547951ac-bff8-56f0-a1dc-b99278071225', 'word_count': 398, 'uri': 'nyt://article/547951ac-bff8-56f0-a1dc-b99278071225'}, {'abstract': 'The cheesemonger is to wed the owner of Heritage Foods.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/11/slow-trip-to-the-altar-for-saxelby-and-martins/', 'snippet': 'The cheesemonger is to wed the owner of Heritage Foods.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Locavores in love is how you could describe the newly minted engagement of Anne Saxelby, the owner of Saxelby Cheesemongers in the Essex Street Market, and Patrick Martins, the former head of Slow Food’s New York chapter, who now owns Heritage Foods USA, an online market for heirloom meats and other products.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Slow Trip to the Altar for Saxelby and Martins', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martins, Patrick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Essex Street Market', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Slow Food', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-11T18:00:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/3cda8797-4f15-5019-9327-9a4ff0e6dc40', 'word_count': 154, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3cda8797-4f15-5019-9327-9a4ff0e6dc40'}, {'abstract': '20th Century Fox moved to shore up its movie marketing operation on Tuesday, naming Oren Aviv, a former top executive at Walt Disney Studios, to the position of chief marketing officer.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/11/twentieth-century-fox-names-ex-disney-exec-as-marketing-chief/', 'snippet': '20th Century Fox moved to shore up its movie marketing operation on Tuesday, naming Oren Aviv, a former top executive at Walt Disney Studios, to the position of chief marketing officer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To shore up its movie marketing operation, 20th Century Fox on Tuesday named Oren Aviv, a former top executive at Walt Disney Studios, to the position of chief marketing officer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '20th Century Fox Names Ex-Disney Exec as Marketing Chief', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'valu