/save-the-date-state-of-the-union-on-january-25/', 'snippet': 'Keeping with protocol, the House speaker invites the president to speak before Congress on Jan. 25.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The House speaker, John A. Boehner of Ohio, on Tuesday officially invited President Obama to deliver a State of the Union address on Jan. 25. The invitation, of course, is a formality given that the nation has long come to expect the annual address. And yet, it is a brief reminder that the president and Congress represent separate, coequal branches of government – and that Mr. Obama’s appearance in the House\xa0 is by invitation, not by demand.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Save the Date: State of the Union on Jan. 25', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-11T19:39:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By David M. Herszenhorn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/a3bc5737-29ae-5319-aa0c-72729c70c19e', 'word_count': 416, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a3bc5737-29ae-5319-aa0c-72729c70c19e'}, {'abstract': 'The Iraqi government is investigating a shootout between an Iraqi fishing boat and a Kuwaiti coast guard vessel on Monday that left a Kuwaiti serviceman dead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/world/middleeast/12iraq.html', 'snippet': 'The Iraqi government is investigating a shootout between an Iraqi fishing boat and a Kuwaiti coast guard vessel on Monday that left a Kuwaiti serviceman dead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD \x97 The Iraqi government is investigating a shootout on Monday between an Iraqi fishing boat and a Kuwaiti Coast Guard vessel in 