g 9-year-old Christina Green’s hand when the girl was shot.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/us/12hileman.html', 'snippet': 'Suzi Hileman was holding 9-year-old Christina Green’s hand when the girl was shot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUCSON \x97 It was not unusual for Suzi Hileman to shuttle children in her neighborhood from one event to the next. She particularly loved finding ways to introduce young girls to smart, strong role models. So it was when she took Christina Green, a 9-year-old neighbor, to meet Representative Gabrielle Giffords on Saturday morning. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For One Victim, Recovery Means Coping With Young Neighbor’s Death', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For One Victim, Recovery Means Coping With Young Neighbor’s Death', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tucson Shooting (2011)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Green, Christina Taylor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-11T22:02:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Medina', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Medina', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/84ef2636-dbfe-5d37-89b6-03ad482d325f', 'word_count': 339, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84ef2636-dbfe-5d37-89b6-03ad482d325f'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the career of Judith Jamison, the artistic director of Alvin Ailey American Dance Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2008/02/29/arts/20080229_JAMISON_SLIDESHOW_index.html', 'snippet': 'A look at the career of Judith Jamison, the artistic director of Alvin Ailey American Dance Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A look at the career of Judith Jamison, the artistic direct