r Game player pool.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/11/rangers-to-send-two-to-all-star-game/', 'snippet': 'New York Rangers defenseman Marc Staal and goalie Henrik Lundqvist have been selected by the N.H.L. for the All-Star Game player pool.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rangers defenseman Marc Staal and goalie Henrik Lundqvist have been selected by the N.H.L. for the All-Star Game player pool, the league announced.They will go into the draft conducted on the Friday preceding the Jan. 30 game at Raleigh, N.C., and be chosen by either the Eastern or Western Conference captain.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rangers to Send Two to All-Star Game', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lundqvist, Henrik', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Staal, Marc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T00:09:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/decef415-20d2-5e71-994b-b684b4a8c304', 'word_count': 178, 'uri': 'nyt://article/decef415-20d2-5e71-994b-b684b4a8c304'}, {'abstract': 'ABC’s latest medical drama takes young, idealistic (and buff) doctors to a remote jungle clinic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/arts/television/12map.html', 'snippet': 'ABC’s latest medical drama takes young, idealistic (and buff) doctors to a remote jungle clinic.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Off