s.com/2011/01/12/business/12pipeline.html', 'snippet': 'The Trans Alaska Pipeline System has temporarily restarted the flow of oil, though repairs were not complete on a leak that forced a shutdown on Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON \x97 Worried about the effect of freezing temperatures, the operator of the Trans Alaska Pipeline System said Wednesday that it had temporarily restarted the flow of oil through its 800-mile network, even though repairs had not yet been completed on the leak that forced the shutdown of the system on Saturday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oil Pipeline in Alaska Has Plan to Restart', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Alaskan Oil Pipeline Restarts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BP Plc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pipelines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T02:20:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Clifford Krauss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Clifford', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krauss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3efbff7c-a43e-59df-9263-3ab6d81a2f86', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3efbff7c-a43e-59df-9263-3ab6d81a2f86'}, {'abstract': 'The Grand Hyatt, on the East Side of Manhattan, is being kept open during a $130 million renovation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/business/12hyatt.html', 'snippet': 'The Grand Hyatt, on the East Side of Manhattan, is being kept open during a $130 million renovation.', 'lead_paragraph':