es who had participated in 2009’s unanimous ruling permitting same-sex marriage. Now several freshman Republican members of the Iowa House are readying a bill calling for the impeachment of the court’s four other justices whose terms were not up for renewal. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Impeachment as Intimidation', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Impeachment as Intimidation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Supreme Courts (State)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Judges', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T04:11:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8f2cf3a-b77f-595c-8af3-7c2b098daab5', 'word_count': 326, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8f2cf3a-b77f-595c-8af3-7c2b098daab5'}, {'abstract': 'The Basque separatist group ETA has announced “permanent” cease-fires before. If it is serious this time, it must drop all political conditions and verifiably disarm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/opinion/12wed4.html', 'snippet': 'The Basque separatist group ETA has announced “permanent” cease-fires before. If it is serious this time, it must drop all political conditions and verifiably disarm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We welcome the announcement of a permanent cease-fire by the Basque separatist group ETA. After taking more than 800 lives since the late-1960s, ETA’s senseless violence cannot end one day too soon. But what should have been an unequivocal renunciation of terrorism fell far short of what the Spanish, and Basque, people were entitled to expect. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Hint of Peace', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Hint of Peace', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ETA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basques', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T04:11:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa3c857a-9acd-59b3-8146-4ee6fa141445', 'word_count': 272, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa3c857a-9acd-59b3-8146-4ee6fa141445'}, {'abstract': 'If Congress wants to win support for offshore drilling, it must take every precaution to reduce the chances of another catastrophe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/opinion/12wed1.html', 'snippet': 'If Congress wants to win support for offshore drilling, it must take every precaution to reduce the chances of another catastrophe.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The most important new message contained in the final report of the presidential commission investigating the gulf oil spill is aimed squarely at Congress: If lawmakers hope to win popular support for ramped-up oil drilling in America’s coastal waters then they must make sure that every possible precaution is taken to reduce the chances of another catastrophe like the spill.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Verdict on the Spill', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Verdict on the Spill', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Offshore Drilling and Exploration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BP Plc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transocean Inc', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gulf of Mexico', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Halliburton Co', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T04:11:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/5f0174d2-7ea4-5a9c-8282-d7fd4e4eaf77', 'word_count': 604, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5f0174d2-7ea4-5a9c-8282-d7fd4e4eaf77'}, {'abstract': 'The F.D.A. doesn’t have enough data to judge whether lap bands can help not-so-obese people safely lose weight and keep it off.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/opinion/12zuckerman.html', 'snippet': 'The F.D.A. doesn’t have enough data to judge whether lap bands can help not-so-obese people safely lose weight and keep it off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Washington', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Playing With the Band', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Playing With the Band', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyword