rning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T05:04:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a720c35-fc9f-59ed-8c88-5374adbc8630', 'word_count': 197, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a720c35-fc9f-59ed-8c88-5374adbc8630'}, {'abstract': 'About half of the kindergarten parents at Public School 101 signed a letter to the principal, Valerie Capitulo-Saide, asking for more unstructured time in the school day, an extra recess period and better procedures in recess.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/education/12kindergarten.html', 'snippet': 'About half of the kindergarten parents at Public School 101 signed a letter to the principal, Valerie Capitulo-Saide, asking for more unstructured time in the school day, an extra recess period and better procedures in recess.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some kindergarten parents at Public School 101, a graceful brick castle in Forest Hills, Queens, wanted more free play time for their children; so they decided to do something about it.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At One School, a Push for More Play Time', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At One School, a Push for More Play Time', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Youth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Forest Hills (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T05:06:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sharon Otterman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sharon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Otterman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c387a7a-281b-5a20-bac7-8d8d91df5866', 'word_count': 705, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c387a7a-281b-5a20-bac7-8d8d91df5866'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Robinson’s record store spawned a remarkable recording business and became a treasured Harlem institution.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/arts/music/12robinson.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Robinson’s record store spawned a remarkable recording business and became a treasured Harlem institution.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bobby Robinson liked to recall how it all began: with him, a World War II veteran, sitting on a fire hydrant in front of a hat shop in Harlem in 1946. Hundreds of people (potential customers?) walked by.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/12/arts/ROBINSON-obit/ROBINSON-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/12/arts/ROBINSON-obit/ROBINSON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/12/arts/ROBINSON-obit/ROBINSON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bobby Robinson, Harlem Music Impresario, Dies at 93', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bobby Robinson, 93, Harlem Music Impresario', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_da