ly invited President Obama to deliver a State of the Union address on Jan. 25. The invitation, of course, is a formality, given that the nation has long come to expect the annual address. The invitation is also, however, a reminder that the president and Congress represent separate, coequal branches of government \x97 and that Mr. Obama’s appearance in the House chamber is by invitation, not by demand. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'State of the Union Speech on Jan. 25', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Washington', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'State of the Union Speech on Jan. 25', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State of the Union Message (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T05:30:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By David M. Herszenhorn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d3060f3-f854-5c4d-8e0f-afd0967f6929', 'word_count': 79, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d3060f3-f854-5c4d-8e0f-afd0967f6929'}, {'abstract': 'While Amar’e Stoudemire struggled, Ronny Turiaf turned into an offensive innovator to help lead the Knicks to an uncharacteristically slow and methodical win.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/12/sports/basketball/12knicks.html', 'snippet': 'While Amar’e Stoudemire struggled, Ronny Turiaf turned into an offensive innovator to help lead the Knicks to