': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/0275913f-52d2-5bb2-b70f-27e41165a71c', 'word_count': 804, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0275913f-52d2-5bb2-b70f-27e41165a71c'}, {'abstract': 'Russian investigators conclude that the pilot in the plane crash that killed Poland’s president and 95 others was under pressure to land in dangerous conditions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/13/world/europe/13crash.html', 'snippet': 'Russian investigators conclude that the pilot in the plane crash that killed Poland’s president and 95 others was under pressure to land in dangerous conditions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW \x97 As Capt. Arkadiusz Protasiuk peered down at a dense fog over the Russian city of Smolensk last April, weighing whether to land an aircraft carrying Poland’s president and dozens of other government officials, no one told him what to do. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/13/world/13crash-cnd-inline1/13crash-cnd-inline1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 880, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/13/world/13crash-cnd-inline1/13crash-cnd-inline1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/13/world/13crash-cnd-inline1/13crash-cnd-inline1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Report on Polish Crash Finds Pilot Error, but Says Powerful Passengers Share Some Blame', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russian Report Cites Pressure On Polish Pilot In Fatal Crash', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank