ddy showed up,” Mr. Crowell’s mother would tell her son.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/13/arts/BOOK/BOOK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 786, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/13/arts/BOOK/BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/13/arts/BOOK/BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sad and True Love Story, Worthy of Its Soundtrack', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sad and True Love Story, Worthy of Its Soundtrack', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ACUFF, ROY', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crowell, Rodney', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Country Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T22:25:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Janet Maslin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Janet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Maslin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/999b6130-a988-5f5f-83a6-f018362a7bf9', 'word_count': 1001, 'uri': 'nyt://article/999b6130-a988-5f5f-83a6-f018362a7bf9'}, {'abstract': 'The F.B.I. said Wednesday that federal background checks on people in Arizona seeking to buy handguns have increased sharply follow