 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/13/arts/SKEWER2/SKEWER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Another Film Bites a Hand In Hollywood', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Another Film Bites a Hand In Hollywood', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Izzard, Eddie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schreiber, Liev', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murphy, Ryan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T22:34:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6ce6519-d57b-5ebc-bd82-8533fac261ca', 'word_count': 979, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6ce6519-d57b-5ebc-bd82-8533fac261ca'}, {'abstract': 'For the first time a New York Philharmonic music director will direct the Juilliard School’s conducting program.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/13/arts/music/13conductor.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time a New York Philharmonic music director will direct the Juilliard School’s conducting program.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In one building at Lincoln Center the music director of the New York Philharmonic plies his trade and is by definition at the pinnacle of the conducting profession. Just across 65th Street, eager young conducting students at the Juilliard School toil and dream of big careers on the podium.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/13/arts/gilbert/gilbert-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 726, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gilbert to Head Juilliard’s Conducting Program', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gilbert to Head Juilliard’s Conducting Program', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Philharmonic', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gilbert, Alan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Juilliard School', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T22:36:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf7bccc1-84e8-587c-813c-73bd3da48ea6', 'word_count': 752, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf7bccc1-84e8-587c-813c-73bd3da48ea6'}, {'abstract': 'African-American models helped win the style wars with France in 1973.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/13/fashion/13Costume.html', 'snippet': 'African-American models helped win the style wars with France in 1973.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN the annals of fashion smackdowns, few events have attained anything resembling the legendary status of the 1973 Grand Divertissement à Versailles. A stunt benefit ginned up by Eleanor Lambert, the publicist who invented the Best Dressed List, this fabled fashion show, promoted as a Franco-American collaboration, was always destined to be seen as a battle for dominance: the Old World slugging it out with the New, a muscular group of comers with Studio 54 as their shared point of reference taking on the fusty world of the haute couture. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/13/fashion/13VERSAILLES-D/13VERSAILLES-D-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/13/fashion/13VERSAILLES-D/13VERSAILLES-D-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/13/fashion/13VERSAILLES-D/Z-JP-VERSAILLES-D-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 777, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/13/fashion/13VERSAILLES-D/13VERSAILLES-D-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/13/fashion/13VERSAILLES-D/13VERSAILLES-D-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking Back at American Fashion’s Coming-Out Party', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'American Fashion’s Coming-Out in Paris', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-12T22:38:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Guy Trebay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Guy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Trebay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organizatio