e, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ea38663-cf69-556a-af09-2c1696ba4a9c', 'word_count': 902, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ea38663-cf69-556a-af09-2c1696ba4a9c'}, {'abstract': 'A text of President Obama’s prepared address to honor those killed and wounded on Jan. 8 by a gunman, as released by the White House.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/13/us/politics/13obama-text.html', 'snippet': 'A text of President Obama’s prepared address to honor those killed and wounded on Jan. 8 by a gunman, as released by the White House.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Following is a text of President Obama’s prepared address on Wednesday to honor those killed and wounded in a shooting on Jan. 8, as released by the White House.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama’s Remarks in Tucson', 'kicker': 'Text', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': "Obama's Remarks in Tucson", 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-13T01:45:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Text', '_id': 'nyt://article/278c09d9-644e-5a1f-9814-d73e9f51308c', 'word_count': 2562, 'uri': 'nyt://article/278c09d9-644e-5a1f-9814-d73e9f51308c'}, {'abstract': 'An American teenager detained in Kuwait said in an interview that he underwent a heated interrogation by F.B.I. agents on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/13/world/middleeast/13detain.html', 'snippet': 'An American teenager detained in Kuwait said in an interview that he underwent a heated interrogation by F.B.I. agents on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON \x97 An American teenager detained in Kuwait said he underwent a heated interrogation by F.B.I. agents for several hours on Wednesday, in a cas