f6ad66731795', 'word_count': 928, 'uri': 'nyt://article/514a694d-305d-58dd-963d-f6ad66731795'}, {'abstract': 'The announcement comes a few days after Renault held disciplinary hearings as a prelude to dismissing three suspended executives.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/14/business/global/14renault.html', 'snippet': 'The announcement comes a few days after Renault held disciplinary hearings as a prelude to dismissing three suspended executives.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS \x97 The automaker Renault filed a criminal complaint on Thursday in an industrial espionage case in which it asserts that a foreign company sought to obtain secrets related to its electric car program.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/business/Renault/Renault-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 584, 'width': 438, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Renault Files Criminal Complaint of Industrial Espionage', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Renault Files Criminal Complaint of Industrial Espionage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Renault SA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Industrial Espionage', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric Vehicles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-13T18:28:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Jolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jolly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://ar