nciaga-pre-fall-collection/', 'snippet': 'Amid the cool cacophony of patterns and prints, Nicolas Ghesquière provides a welcome blast from the past.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Pre-Fall Collections, being shown in New York over the next several weeks, arrive in stores in May to fill the gap between bikinis and furs. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Balenciaga Pre-Fall Collection', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-13T20:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alix Browne', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alix', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Browne', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bab7314-22d4-5746-ae4f-0b53403bbce7', 'word_count': 141, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bab7314-22d4-5746-ae4f-0b53403bbce7'}, {'abstract': 'Individuals who buy over-the-counter cold medications to sell on to methamphetamine producers.', 'web_url': 'https://schott.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/13/pill-brokers/', 'snippet': 'Individuals who buy over-the-counter cold medications to sell on to methamphetamine producers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Individuals who buy over-the-counter cold medications to sell on to methamphetamine producers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pill Brokers', 'kicker': 'Schott&#039;s Vocab', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Methamphetamines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-13T20:00:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben