gly alienated wives of the polygamist Bill Henrickson (Bill Paxton), who, by the end of the erratic fourth season, had won a seat in the Utah State Senate and came forward with his unusual domestic arrangement.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14BIGLOVE-1/BIGLOVE-1294859105620-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14BIGLOVE-1/BIGLOVE-1294859105620-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14BIGLOVE-1/BIGLOVE-1294859105620-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14BIGLOVE-1/BIGLOVE-1294859105620-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14BIGLOVE-1/BIGLOVE-1294859105620-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'My Wives Don’t Understand Me', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'My Wives Don’t Understand Me', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paxton, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-13T22:48:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ginia Bellafante', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ginia', 'm