uck.” In the movie his presumed surrogate, Ned (Liev Schreiber), is a writer for a popular New York-based medical drama whose creative team sits around at meetings making wisecracks like “sex with one’s dog is the new sex with one’s cat” while dreaming up outrageous plot turns involving cannibalism, bestiality and castration.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14EVERY-span/EVERY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14EVERY-span/EVERY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 351}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14EVERY-span/EVERY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14EVERY-span/EVERY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/14/arts/14EVERY-span/EVERY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'If It’s Not One Thing, It’s Another', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Every Day'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'If It’s Not One Thing, It’s Another', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schreiber, Liev', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Izzard, Eddie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hunt, Helen', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dennehy, Brian', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hom