premier theater companies, Jude Law (“Hamlet”) will play Mat Burke and London theater actress Ruth Wilson will play the title character in Eugene O’Neill’s classic “Anna Christie.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/13/jude-law-eddie-redmayne-will-help-michael-grandage-bow-out-at-donmar/', 'snippet': 'For Michael Grandage’s final season as artistic director of the Donmar Warehouse, one of London’s premier theater companies, Jude Law (“Hamlet”) will play Mat Burke and London theater actress Ruth Wilson will play the title character in Eugene O’N...', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Michael Grandage’s final season as artistic director of the Donmar Warehouse, one of London’s premier theater companies, Jude Law (“Hamlet”) will play Mat Burke and London theater actress Ruth Wilson will play the title character in Eugene O’Neill’s classic “Anna Christie,” the theater announced on Thursday night. The production, directed by Rob Ashford, is set to run Aug. 4-Oct. 9.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jude Law, Eddie Redmayne Will Help Michael Grandage Bow Out at Donmar', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-14T00:30:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc7e7b69-6314-5f1a-8fee-4c1d7e4c43d7', 'word_count': 196, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc7e7b69-6314-5f1a-8fee-4c1d7e4c43d7'}, {'abstract': 'Alex Cox’s “Repo” franchise goes off the rails with Jaclyn Jonet’s spectacularly shallow performance in “Repo Chick.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/14/movies/14repo.html', 'snippet': 'Alex Cox’s “Repo” franc