The troubled bookseller eliminated 15 managerial positions on Thursday as it seeks to stay afloat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/14/business/media/14borders.html', 'snippet': 'The troubled bookseller eliminated 15 managerial positions on Thursday as it seeks to stay afloat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a meeting with publishers on Thursday, Borders laid out a more detailed proposal for moving the troubled company forward, including asking publishers to provide money for a large portion of the company’s debt as a loan, according to people briefed on the matter.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Borders Said to Be Close to Securing Refinancing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Borders Said to Be Close to Securing Refinancing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Borders Group Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-14T03:15:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ab03bd3-c4c4-50f5-a69d-1b9dc81309d8', 'word_count': 239, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ab03bd3-c4c4-50f5-a69d-1b9dc81309d8'}, {'abstract': 'The Falcons are favorites for their divisional playoff game against the Packers, but the scandal-free team prefers to fly under the radar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/14/sports/football/14falcons.html', 'snippet': 'The Falcons are favorites for their divisional playoff game against the Packers, but the scandal-free team prefers to fly under the radar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLOWERY BRANCH, Ga. \x97 Watching his flat-screen TV lately has frustrated Ovie Mughelli, not just because of loud commercials and the recent spate of midseason reruns.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/sports/JPFALCONS1/JPFALCONS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Falcons, Only Thing Flashy Is Their Record', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A 13-3 Record, A No. 1 Seeding, And Little Fanfare', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'White, Roddy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Finneran, Brian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Green Bay Packers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vick, Michael', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Revis, Darrelle', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Falcons', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gonzalez, Tony', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-14T03:18:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Tierney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tierney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f2e680c-e9b0-547f-9e97-0decdc56f973', 'word_count': 850, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f2e680c-e9b0-547f-9e97-0decdc56f973'}, {'abstract': 'Patriots receiver Wes Welker, who shredded his left knee ligaments last year, is healthy for the playoffs this season, and the team and Tom Brady are thrilled to have him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/14/sports/football/14welker.html', 'snippet': 'Patriots receiver Wes Welker, who shredded his left knee ligaments last year, is healthy for the playoffs this season, and the team and Tom Brady are thrilled to have him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOXBOROUGH, Mass. \x97 A year ago, when Tom Brady was being hounded and harassed by the Baltimore Ravens’ defense in a playoff game, Wes Welker was watching helplessly from the owner’s box at Gillette Stadium. He was unable to provide Brady with the kind of target that has made him one of the most valuable receivers in football the past four years.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/sports/YWELKER/YWELKER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/14/sports/YWELKER/YWELKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/14/sports/YWELKER/YWELKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Healthy Welker Helps Patriots to Reconnect', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Healthy Welker Helps Patriots to Reconnect', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Welker, Wes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brady, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 4, 'm