 share for Genzyme, the biotech firm it has been trying to acquire by hostile takeover since October, the French newspaper Le Figaro reported Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sanofi Is Said to Raise Ceiling on Genzyme Bid', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Genzyme Corp', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sanofi-Aventis S.A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-14T13:52:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris V. Nicholson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': 'V.', 'lastname': 'Nicholson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf7dc7e6-adc9-54b9-8f00-a34080bf0e3b', 'word_count': 305, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf7dc7e6-adc9-54b9-8f00-a34080bf0e3b'}, {'abstract': 'Retail sales were helped by vehicle and furniture sales, while the Consumer Price Index, excluding food and energy, rose only 0.1 percent in December.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/15/business/economy/15econ.html', 'snippet': 'Retail sales were helped by vehicle and furniture sales, while the Consumer Price Index, excluding food and energy, rose only 0.1 percent in December.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Retail sales rose in December, contributing to a quarter of stronger consumer spending during the holiday shopping season, economists and government reports said on Friday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/15/business/Econ/Econ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {