ony at Temple Beth Sholom, where he is senior rabbi, with Rabbi Gerald C. Skolnik taking part.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/16/fashion/weddings/16OBERFIELD.html', 'snippet': 'The bridegroom’s father is to perform the ceremony at Temple Beth Sholom, where he is senior rabbi, with Rabbi Gerald C. Skolnik taking part.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Talya Danis Oberfield, a daughter of Naomi Danis of Forest Hills, Queens, and the late Gil R. Oberfield, is to be married in Roslyn Heights, N.Y., Sunday to Ari Shalom Lucas, the son of Edy Haber Lucas and Rabbi Alan B. Lucas of Roslyn Heights. The bridegroom’s father is to perform the ceremony at Temple Beth Sholom, where he is senior rabbi, with Rabbi Gerald C. Skolnik taking part. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/fashion/weddings/16OBERFIELD/16OBERFIELD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 957, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/fashion/weddings/16OBERFIELD/16OBERFIELD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/16/fashion/weddings/16OBERFIELD/16OBERFIELD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Talya Oberfield and Ari Lucas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Talya Oberfield, Ari Lucas', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-14T16:47:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_m