or a key piece to the championship puzzle?', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/14/discussing-the-rafael-soriano-deal/', 'snippet': 'Join the discussion on the merits of the Yankees’ acquisition of Rafael Soriano. Is he an overpriced setup man, or a key piece to the championship puzzle?', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Ben Shpigel reported in Friday’s Times, the Yankees “improved their pitching staff Thursday night by working backward,” committing up to $35 million over three years for Rafael Soriano, 31, who had 45 saves for Tampa Bay last season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Discussing the Rafael Soriano Deal', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivera, Mariano', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Soriano, Rafael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-14T18:22:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Plutnicki', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Plutnicki', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/80b23ce2-4e00-5a1f-90c5-31c2896e7193', 'word_count': 301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80b23ce2-4e00-5a1f-90c5-31c2896e7193'}, {'abstract': 'Gregg Araki continues to explore the turmoil of the young in his new film, “Kaboom.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/16/movies/16araki.html', 'snippet': 'Gregg Araki continues to explore the turmoil of the young in his new film, “Kaboom.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEST HOLLYWOOD, Calif. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'cap