ls are now among the city’s most desirable drinking destinations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'REVELERS searching for a spot to celebrate in hard-partying Barcelona have always had ample options, from thumping multilevel clubs to cramped hole-in-the-wall cava bars. But lately, Barcelona has taken a page from the New York bar scene, with newly fashionable hotel bars attracting stylish Barcelonans in addition to guests. No longer lonely hangouts mostly populated by jet-lagged travelers, the bars and lounges at luxury hotels are now among the city’s most desirable drinking destinations. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/travel/16heads-span/16heads-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/16/travel/16heads-span/16heads-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/travel/16heads-span/16HEADS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/travel/16heads-span/16heads-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/16/travel/16heads-span/16heads-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hotel Bars in Barcelona Attract More Than Their Guests', 'kicker': 'Heads Up', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Hotels in Barcelona, a Bar Scene Emerges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'