or now, at least, the president seems to have put an end to the endless blame game over whose political rhetoric apparently forced a violent lunatic to shoot a woman he’d been fixated on for years. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'There’s a New Sheriff in Politics', 'kicker': 'Opinionator', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dupnik, Clarence W', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Giffords, Gabrielle', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Limbaugh, Rush', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palin, Sarah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Daily Kos', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tucson (Ariz)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-15T00:30:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tobin Harshaw', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tobin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harshaw', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/6cd2a072-6284-5d63-9b23-ff8b7fb459ca', 'word_count': 2048, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6cd2a072-6284-5d63-9b23-ff8b7fb459ca'}, {'abstract': 'Seeing a need to help patients, especially young ones, whose appetites are often weak, Pnina Peled makes meals to order.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/16/nyregion/16sloan.html', 'snippet': 'Seeing a need to help patients, especially young ones, whose appetites are often weak, Pnina Peled makes meals to order.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JULIEN COLLOT, who is 8 and has had leukemia, has been on a low-microbial diet since his two bone-marrow transplants, in 2006 and 2007. When he developed diabetes last year, he had to go low-fat and low-sugar as well.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/nyregion/16jpCHEF2/16jpCHEF2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/16/nyregion/16jpCHEF2/16jpCHEF2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/nyregion/16jpCHEF2/16jpCHEF2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/nyregion/16jpCHEF2/16jpCHEF2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/16/nyregion/16jpCHEF2/16jpCHEF2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Healing, Meals Made to Order', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Healing, Meals Made To Order', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Memorial Sloan-Kettering Cancer Center', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chefs', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-15T00:35:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'bylin