il the announcement of nominees for the Academy Awards. But after that, there will only be about five seconds of anticipation until \x97 spoiler alert! \x97 the probable victors are divined by any number of movie critics and entertainment news sites.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/fashion/16dress1_span/16dress1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/16/fashion/16dress1_span/16dress1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/16/fashion/16dress1_span/16dress1_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/16/fashion/16dress1_span/16dress1_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'They’re Off! Let the Second-Guessing Begin', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'They’re Off! Let the Second-Guessing Begin', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dresses', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-15T01:49:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b1099d30-766d-573a-bc98-14abc82ff9b1', 'word_count': 662, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b1099d30-766d-573a-bc98-14abc82ff9b1'}, {'abstract': 'Gunfire and tear gas in Romania figure early in the biography of Zoltan Mesko, N.F.L. rookie.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/15/sports/football/15patriots.html', 'snippet': 'Gunfire and tear gas in Romania figure early in the biography of Zoltan Mesko, N.F.L. rookie.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOXBOROUGH, Mass. \x97 About the same time the Jets were throwing obscenities around their locker room this week, a few New England Patriots players were engaged in discussions on scholarly subjects like biodiversity and genetics. Linebacker Jerod Mayo and punter Zoltan Mesko were discussing the human genome when Mesko revealed that his father, Michael, was a pro bowler.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/15/sports/patriots-1/patriots-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/15/sports/patriots-1/patriots-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/15/sports/patriots-1/patriots-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From a Boy in a Revolt to the Patriots’ Punter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From a Boy in a Revolt To the Patriots’ Punter, Setting a Rookie Mark', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subje