iLeaks, said that he requested that Private Manning be released from detention at Quantico Marine Base.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The lawyer for Pfc. Bradley Manning, 23, the Army intelligence analyst accused of leaking classified material to WikiLeaks, said in a blog post that he had submitted a request to the military that Private Manning be released from pretrial detention at Quantico Marine Base in Virginia. The lawyer, David E. Coombs, said he had received no response from the military to an earlier demand that restrictions on Private Manning in the military brig be eased. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Release Sought for Soldier Held for Leaks', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | WASHINGTON', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Release Sought for Soldier Held for Leaks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WikiLeaks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Bradley E', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-15T03:45:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Shane', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shane', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8209fd7-dd5c-5d8a-b74d-cc71c9be2a39', 'word_count': 78, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8209fd7-dd5c-5d8a-b74d-cc71c9be2a39'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Lipman put forth a radical idea: that the littlest pupils are helped by thinking about big ideas.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/15/education/15lipman.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Lipman put forth a radical idea: 