ps://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/17/just-one-look-bally-pre-fall-collection/', 'snippet': 'Graeme Fidler and Michael Herz are taking Bally’s heritage as a leather house seriously, but they also seem to be having a lot of fun with it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Pre-Fall Collections, being shown in New York over the next several weeks, arrive in stores in May to fill the gap between bikinis and furs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Bally Pre-Fall Collection', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-17T14:00:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alix Browne', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alix', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Browne', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/1aa2979a-1330-5d4f-a994-8e745f637553', 'word_count': 98, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1aa2979a-1330-5d4f-a994-8e745f637553'}, {'abstract': 'In Rex Ryan’s world, the Jets are only halfway home. His road to Truthville has already traveled through outposts called Outrageousville and Sarcasticville. And Superville is not far down the road.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/17/underestimating-the-jets-year-2-continued/', 'snippet': 'In Rex Ryan’s world, the Jets are only halfway home. His road to Truthville has already traveled through outposts called Outrageousville and Sarcasticville. And Superville is not far down the road.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So where do the Jets go from here? In Rex Ryan’s world, they are only halfway home. His road to Truthville has already traveled through outposts called Outrageousville and Sarcasticville. But with Superville not far down the road, Ryan had better be careful. Because if he can keep flooring the gas pedal of the Jets’ bandwagon, he just may end up getting his sweater vest retired into the Jets ring of honor next to the No. 12 of Joe Namath, the Jets’ most famous prognosticator.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Underestimating the Jets, Year 2, Continued', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-17T14:00:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By George Bretherton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'George', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bretherton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/b77605e6-4896-5e0a-8f0e-54e9fef2b66f', 'word_count': 639, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b77605e6-4896-5e0a-8f0e-54e9fef2b66f'}, {'abstract': 'Monday Morning Skate: Why the N.H.L. trade deadline isn’t creating more buzz; Colorado’s Ryan O’Reilly’s scary crash turns out O.K.; Jordan Staal helps Penguins survive Sidney Crosby’s absence.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/17/monday-morning-skate-quiet-rumor-mill-oreilly-scare-penguins-staal-shines/', 'snippet': 'Monday Morning Skate: Why the N.H.L. trade deadline isn’t creating more buzz; Colorado’s Ryan O’Reilly’s scary crash turns out O.K.; Jordan Staal helps Penguins survive Sidney Crosby’s absence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Seven things you should know about the weekend in the National Hockey League:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Monday Morning Skate: