ationship between China and the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/18/one-companys-struggles-in-china/', 'snippet': 'A Wisconsin manufacturer is a good illustration of why the exchange rate is far from the full story of the economic relationship between China and the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In today’s Washington Post, Howard Schneider has an excellent profile of one American company trying to grow its business in China:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Company’s Struggles in China', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Trade Organization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-18T17:06:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Leonhardt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leonhardt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/a00e0e4e-1022-5d7a-a7c4-065f64f03a18', 'word_count': 416, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a00e0e4e-1022-5d7a-a7c4-065f64f03a18'}, {'abstract': 'Fill in the blanks in this article about the teams in the N.F.L. playoffs. Use your own words and phrases, or choose from a scrambled list of the words or phrases that were removed.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/18/fill-in-n-f-l-playoffs/', 'snippet': 'Fill in the blanks in this article about the teams in the N.F.L. playoffs. Use your own words and phrases, or choose from a scrambled list of the words or phrases that were removed.', 'lead_paragraph': '