 475, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb3a4fb4-60bd-5e07-8231-32472717dd06'}, {'abstract': 'But G. Wayne Clough says he wishes he had taken more time and held more consultations before deciding.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/18/smithsonian-chief-defends-withdrawal-of-video/', 'snippet': 'But G. Wayne Clough says he wishes he had taken more time and held more consultations before deciding.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The top official of the Smithsonian, G. Wayne Clough, who has been sharply criticized for his decision late last year to remove a video from an exhibition at the National Portrait Gallery, defended that decision in a telephone interview on Tuesday morning. He said it was in the interest of protecting the exhibition as a whole, as well as protecting the Smithsonian’s larger educational mission and its ability to make a strong case to Congress for federal support.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Smithsonian Chief Defends Withdrawal of Video', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clough, G Wayne', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wojnarowicz, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Portrait Gallery', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Smithsonian Institution', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-18T17:36:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8aa2e0c-b8fd-5ce9-9