m/2011/01/20/us/20doctor.html', 'snippet': 'A 69-year-old Philadelphia family practitioner was charged with the murder of seven babies and one adult patient.', 'lead_paragraph': ' An abortion doctor who served minority and immigrant women in his clinic in Philadelphia was charged with multiple counts of murder on Wednesday in the deaths of a woman and seven newborn babies whose spinal cords had been cut with scissors, the district attorney’s office said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/20/us/DOCTOR-1/DOCTOR-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Doctor Is Charged in Killing of Newborns', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Doctor Charged in Deaths of Woman and 7 Babies in Philadelphia Clinic', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philadelphia (Pa)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mongar, Karnamaya', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gosnell, Kermit', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Women's Medical Society (West Philadelphia, Pa)", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-19T20:16:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sabrina Tavernise', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sabrina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tavernise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60805610-fa15-5b7e-ba3a-4579f78fb7b9', 'word_count': 413, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60805610-fa15-5b7e-ba3a-4579f78fb7b9'}, {'abstract': 'Sales continue to slide.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/19/another-new-low-on-billboard-chart/', 'snippet': 'Sales continue to slide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For a stark illustration of how record sales have changed in recent years, take a look at Billboard’s charts this week for albums and track downloads.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Another New Low Atop Billboard Chart', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-19T20:20:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/606c01c7-36b0-5b80-b808-e2c853475cc0', 'word_count': 423, 'uri': 'nyt://article/606c01c7-36b0-5b80-b808-e2c853475cc0'}, {'abstract': 'Rejiggered astrology signs; people who didn’t have a Tiger Mother; Starbucks’s Trenta supersize is coming in May; and other topics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/fashion/20crib.html', 'snippet': 'Rejiggered astrology signs; people who didn’t have a Tiger Mother; Starbucks’s Trenta supersize is coming in May; and other topics.', 'lead_paragraph': ' 1. Rejiggered astrology signs. The world’s worst pickup line gets needed freshening. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Eight Things to Talk About This Weekend', 'kicker': 'Crib Sheet', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Eight Things To Talk About This Weekend', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gossip', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_dat