 and murder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/opinion/20thu2.html', 'snippet': 'Jean-Claude Duvalier, the former Haitian dictator, should answer for his squalid legacy of disappearance, torture and murder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Haiti’s troubles turned even more surreal over the weekend when the former dictator Jean-Claude Duvalier, known as Baby Doc, showed up in Port-au-Prince after nearly 25 years of exile. After two nights in a hotel, surrounded by sycophants and unanswered questions, Mr. Duvalier was taken into custody for four hours on Tuesday and then officially charged with embezzlement and corruption \x97 an encouraging development, although theft was only one of his many crimes. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Last Thing Haiti Needs', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Last Thing Haiti Needs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Haiti', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duvalier, Jean-Claude', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Preval, Rene', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T03:13:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/53aa30c0-b36b-5499-9770-ccb3271a87da', 'word_count': 407, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53aa30c0-b36b-5499-9770-ccb3271a87da'}, {'abstract': 'The Vatican’s insistence that it never impeded criminal investigations of pedophile priests has been thrown into doubt.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/opinion/20thu3.html', 'snippet': 'The Vatican’s insistence that it never impeded criminal investigations of pedophile priests has been thrown into do