d.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A creative hole was filled on Wednesday in the $65 million Broadway musical “Spider-Man: Turn Off the Dark” with the addition of a technically ambitious finale, after seven weeks during which the show was playing for audiences with a temporary ending in place.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Spider-Man’ Musical Adds an Airborne Finale', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Spider-Man’ Musical Adds an Airborne Finale', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T04:57:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e6fae99-bd29-55f5-a379-981a90d67066', 'word_count': 290, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e6fae99-bd29-55f5-a379-981a90d67066'}, {'abstract': 'Lebanon on Wednesday introduced a draft resolution in the Security Council condemning Israeli settlement expansion on West Bank territory occupied since 1967.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/world/20briefs-Settlements.html', 'snippet': 'Lebanon on Wednesday introduced a draft resolution in the Security Council condemning Israeli settlement expansion on West Bank territory occupied since 1967.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Lebanon on Wednesday introduced a draft resolution in the Security Council condemning Israeli settlement expansion on West Bank territory occupied since 1967. No vote is expected soon because the United States criticized the resolution, arguing that the Council should not be the forum for addressing knotty Arab-Israeli issues. A veto would be awkward because the language used in the resolution, which attracted some 120 co-sponsors, echoes previous statements that Washington has endorsed condemning settlements, diplomats said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lebanon Condemns Israeli Settlements in Resolution', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | UNITED NATIONS', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lebanon Condemns Israeli Settlements in Resolution', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lebanon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Israeli Settlements', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T04:59:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil MacFarquhar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacFarquhar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ec76677-3c9c-5baa-a51f-ddfd1a0e2ac6', 'word_count': 76, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ec76677-3c9c-5baa-a51f-ddfd1a0e2ac6'}, {'abstract': 'The company said it would lower the price of fresh produce and cut sugar, fat and salt in its house brands, and would press other food manufacturers to do the same.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/business/20walmart.html', 'snippet': 'The company said it would lower the price of fresh produce and cut sugar, fat and salt in its house brands, and would press other food manufacturers to do the same.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Wal-Mart, the nation’s largest retailer, will announce a five-year plan on Thursday to make t