'lead_paragraph': 'The Wendy’s/Arby’s Group, the restraurant operator whose largest investor is Nelson Peltz, said on Thursday that it would explore a sale of the Arby’s chain, known for its roast beef sandwiches. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Arby’s Fast-Food Chain Is Up for Sale', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peltz, Nelson', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "ARBY'S INC", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Wendy's International Inc", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T13:21:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/63a0dc3b-b360-5bcf-8179-d8afac314689', 'word_count': 322, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63a0dc3b-b360-5bcf-8179-d8afac314689'}, {'abstract': 'Jets Coach Rex Ryan, quarterback Mark Sanchez and cornerback Darrelle Revis spoke to reporters Wednesday about the coming A.F.C. title game.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/ryan-sanchez-and-revis-transcripts/', 'snippet': 'Jets Coach Rex Ryan, quarterback Mark Sanchez and cornerback Darrelle Revis spoke to reporters Wednesday about the coming A.F.C. title game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Transcripts for the conference calls of Jets Coach Rex Ryan, quarterback Mark Sanchez and cornerback Darrelle Revis on Wednesday, as provided by the N.F.L.:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Ryan, Sanchez and Revis Transcripts', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub'