The Washington National Opera and the Kennedy Center are merging their administrative functions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The financially troubled Washington National Opera is merging administrative functions with the John F. Kennedy Center for the Performing Arts, the two organizations announced this morning. The move is intended to stabilize the opera company, which in recent years has reduced its season and borrowed against its endowment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Washington National Opera and the Kennedy Center Agree to Merge', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Domingo, Placido', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaiser, Michael M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kennedy, John F, Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington National Opera', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T14:58:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f298023-5beb-5996-bd63-e4ad5b3aeb2d', 'word_count': 584, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f298023-5beb-5996-bd63-e4ad5b3aeb2d'}, {'abstract': 'Term for the ageless visage created with fillers, Botox, chemical peels, and the like.', 'web_url': 'https://schott.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/year-zero-face/', 'snippet': 'Term for the ageless visage created with fillers, Botox, chemical peels, and the like.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Term for the ageless visage created with fillers, Botox, chemical peels, and the like.Writing for The Guardian, Eva Wiseman pinpointed “the very