rket this summer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Mitsubishi, 3-D Writ Large', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television Sets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Three-Dimensional Devices and Effects', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mitsubishi Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T15:14:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roy Furchgott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Furchgott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/480d68b0-7404-581f-a281-ad45ad19fb2a', 'word_count': 276, 'uri': 'nyt://article/480d68b0-7404-581f-a281-ad45ad19fb2a'}, {'abstract': 'Some tennis players just like seeing certain opponents on the other side of the net.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/your-ranking-the-nemesis-doesnt-care/', 'snippet': 'Some tennis players just like seeing certain opponents on the other side of the net.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some tennis players just like seeing certain opponents on the other side of the net.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Your Ranking? The Nemesis Doesn’t Care', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Australian Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Federer, Roger', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T15:15:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 