r instructor, “You look fat in that costume, and I’m not allowing you to go onstage.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Broadway’s ‘Fat Pig’ Finds Its Title Character', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LaBute, Neil', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T18:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0198bb2-24d8-5ed5-855e-71a008721de0', 'word_count': 548, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0198bb2-24d8-5ed5-855e-71a008721de0'}, {'abstract': 'Dollar Thrifty Automotive Group announced this month that it would ban smoking for travelers renting cars and fine violators $250.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/car-rental-companies-add-no-smoking-signs/', 'snippet': 'Dollar Thrifty Automotive Group announced this month that it would ban smoking for travelers renting cars and fine violators $250.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dollar Thrifty Automotive Group announced this month that it would ban smoking for travelers renting cars at all United States Dollar and Thrifty corporate-owned locations and participating franchise locations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Car Rental Companies Add ‘No Smoking’ Signs', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T18:00:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_