eign policy groups that China’s increased influence and military strength are no cause for alarm.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/in-speech-hu-calls-for-closer-cooperation-with-u-s/', 'snippet': 'President Hu of China told business leaders and foreign policy groups that China’s increased influence and military strength are no cause for alarm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Hu Jintao of China called for closer cooperation with the United States in Southeast Asia and the Pacific Rim in a speech on Thursday, offering an olive branch in a region where China’s increasing influence and military presence have roiled relations between the two powers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Speech, Hu Calls for Closer Cooperation With U.S.', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hu Jintao', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-20T19:10:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Wines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/97bee2d7-5602-5cfa-8f1f-087175d1851e', 'word_count': 359, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97bee2d7-5602-5cfa-8f1f-087175d1851e'}, {'abstract': 'Two Grand Slam champions square off in a marquee third-round match today in the Rod Laver Arena. Justine Henin, whose sterling play so far suggests that her elbow woes are behind her, faces Svetlana Kuznetsova in a match that could easily be a semifinal.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nyt