ntial Donors Struggle for Visas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As U.S. Patients Await Organ Transplants, Potential Donors Struggle for Visas', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Visas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transplants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organ Donation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-21T01:11:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jacqueline Baylon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jacqueline', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baylon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b36fe7ff-e76d-5bb4-a71e-520fe91e3686', 'word_count': 1055, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b36fe7ff-e76d-5bb4-a71e-520fe91e3686'}, {'abstract': 'The arrival of the former star outfielder all but eliminated the possibility of Johnny Damon’s return to the Yankees.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/21/sports/baseball/21base.html', 'snippet': 'The arrival of the former star outfielder all but eliminated the possibility of Johnny Damon’s return to the Yankees.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The Yankees and the free agent Andruw Jones agreed to terms on a one-year, $2 million contract Thursday, all but eliminating the possibility of Johnny Damon’s return to the team. Jones, a right-handed hitter once considered the most gifted center fielder in baseball, will serve as a backup outfielder.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yanks Add Andruw Jones; Newest Met Discusses Injuries', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None