rganization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e720e9a-ea48-55ea-bc6d-072f4aa1e625', 'word_count': 1132, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e720e9a-ea48-55ea-bc6d-072f4aa1e625'}, {'abstract': 'New York Jets fans celebrated at a Times Square pep rally for the team, heading to the A.F.C. championship game this Sunday against Pittsburgh.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/20/jets-fans-unite/', 'snippet': 'New York Jets fans celebrated at a Times Square pep rally for the team, heading to the A.F.C. championship game this Sunday against Pittsburgh.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The workweek hasn’t officially ended yet, but several thousand very excited fans of the New York Jets gathered for a pep rally in Times Square Thursday evening, in anticipation of Sunday’s big A.F.C. championship game against the Pittsburgh Steelers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jets Fans Unite!', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Times Square and 42nd Street (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-21T02:18:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/5f4c24af-4e3b-5c86-ab67-a02aafea88c3', 'word_count': 40, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5f4c24af-4e3b-5c86-ab67-a02aafea88c3'}, {'abstract': 'Less than 24 hours after voting to repeal the new health are law, House Republicans said they would write their own legislation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/21/health/policy/21health.html', 'snippet': 'Less than 24 hours after voting to repeal the new health are law, House Republicans said they would write their own legislation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON \x97 Less than 24 hour