r Peck, the 22-year-old New York City Ballet dancer, reconnects with the choreographer Susan Stroman in a new work, “Frankie and Johnny ... and Rose,” that has its premiere on Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/23/arts/dance/23peck.html', 'snippet': 'Tiler Peck, the 22-year-old New York City Ballet dancer, reconnects with the choreographer Susan Stroman in a new work, “Frankie and Johnny ... and Rose,” that has its premiere on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': '“AND go!” shouted the choreographer and director Susan Stroman, as the New York City Ballet dancer Amar Ramasar pushed a wide-eyed Tiler Peck over the edge of a low platform. Ms. Peck flipped nimbly on her side and rolled under the platform, emerging a few moments later laughing and brushing dust from her leotard. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/arts/PECK/PECK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/23/arts/PECK/PECK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/arts/PECK/PECK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/arts/PECK/PECK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/23/arts/PECK/PECK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Full-Circle Mentor Moment', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Full-Circle Mentor Moment', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'n