have changed, so have the wagers politicians make before major sporting events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 4:55 p.m. | When Rudolph W. Giuliani was mayor of New York and the city’s first fan, he couldn’t wait to make bets with Democrats, Republicans, small-town mayors and big-city counterparts alike, just as long as a New York team was in the playoffs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Putting Civic Pride Where Their Mouths Are for the Big Game', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Giuliani, Rudolph W', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-21T16:59:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liz Robbins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robbins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ffb113a-fab0-57b0-af74-6bb275706402', 'word_count': 430, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ffb113a-fab0-57b0-af74-6bb275706402'}, {'abstract': 'Scenes from the Paris Fashion Week photo diary of Sonny Vandevelde.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/21/photos-of-the-moment-rick-owens-3/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the Paris Fashion Week photo diary of Sonny Vandevelde.', 'lead_paragraph': ' NYTD.fullScreenSlideShowFactory.createSlideshow("#820", 592, 490, true, chameleonData);', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos of the Moment | Rick Owens', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None,