retire will determine the result.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What would you do if your financial planner prescribed the following advice? Save and invest diligently for 30 years, then cross your fingers and pray your investments will double over the last decade before you retire.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/22/your-money/401ks-and-similar-plans/22money-inline/22money-inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 928, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/22/your-money/401ks-and-similar-plans/22money-inline/22money-inline-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/22/your-money/401ks-and-similar-plans/22money-inline/22money-inline-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Retirement Savings, It’s a Sprint to the Finish', 'kicker': 'Your Money', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Retirement Savings Sprint to the Finish', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Savings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Retirement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-21T19:09:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'subsection_name': "401(k)'s and Similar Plans", 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Siegel Bernard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': 'Siegel', 'lastname': 'Be