dline': 'Shamed Into Altering A Mortgage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of America Corp', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreclosures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Housing and Real Estate', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-22T01:13:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Nocera', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nocera', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c61803a-e7b2-55f8-ba71-5ab346a608da', 'word_count': 1724, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c61803a-e7b2-55f8-ba71-5ab346a608da'}, {'abstract': 'The normally verbose Jets did not have much to say about the Steelers this week, but had no problem discussing Bart Scott’s unintentionally hilarious interview.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/22/sports/football/22yapping.html', 'snippet': 'The normally verbose Jets did not have much to say about the Steelers this week, but had no problem discussing Bart Scott’s unintentionally hilarious interview.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. \x97 The Jets are just about done laughing at linebacker Bart Scott’s expense. They have all howled at his testosterone-soaked on-field interview with ESPN after the Jets beat the Patriots. Scott began the interview by imitating a jet plane and ended it screaming “Can’t wait!” at the mention of going to Pittsburgh.', 