one, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8685481-f3ac-5957-b41d-8575f2d98a36', 'word_count': 301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8685481-f3ac-5957-b41d-8575f2d98a36'}, {'abstract': 'Shanghai Gourmet China Bistro in Orange, Conn., is a small, family-run place that serves good, comforting food in an inviting atmosphere.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/23/nyregion/23dinect.html', 'snippet': 'Shanghai Gourmet China Bistro in Orange, Conn., is a small, family-run place that serves good, comforting food in an inviting atmosphere.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEARCHING for an inexpensive place to eat Chinese, similar to the neighborhood restaurants that abound in the city, I was pleased to discover Shanghai Gourmet China Bistro in Orange, a small, family-run place that serves good, comforting food prepared with quality ingredients in an inviting atmosphere.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/nyregion/23dinectsub/23dinectsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/23/nyregion/23dinectsub/23dinectsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/nyregion/23dinectsub/23dinectsub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/nyregion/23dinectsub/23dinectsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/23/nyregion/23dinectsub/23dinectsub-thumbStandard.jpg',