e clothing designs for hundreds of stage productions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/22/arts/design/22aldredge.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Aldredge won an Academy Award for the costumes in “The Great Gatsby,” and created the clothing designs for hundreds of stage productions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Theoni V. Aldredge, who designed the costumes for hundreds of Broadway and Off Broadway productions, including “Annie,” “A Chorus Line” and “La Cage aux Folles,” and who won an Academy Award for her work on “The Great Gatsby,” died on Friday in Stamford, Conn. She was 88. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/22/arts/ALDREDGE1-obit/ALDREDGE1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/22/arts/ALDREDGE1-obit/ALDREDGE1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/22/arts/ALDREDGE1-obit/ALDREDGE1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Theoni V. Aldredge, Costume Designer, Dies at 88', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Theoni Aldredge, 88, Dies;\nWon Oscar for Costumes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Costumes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALDREDGE, THEONI V', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-22T04:41:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'