er and said he would walk out with him. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/sports/Y-STEELERS/Y-STEELERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 859, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/sports/Y-STEELERS/Y-STEELERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/23/sports/Y-STEELERS/Y-STEELERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ward Has Hands, and Comments, You Can Count On', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ward Has Hands, and Comments, You Can Count On', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Steelers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ward, Hines', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-22T19:40:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/115d4368-4191-59f0-b06f-99c5719eda44', 'word_count': 1003, 'uri': 'nyt://article/115d4368-4191-59f0-b06f-99c5719eda44'}, {'abstract': 'The separation agreement includes limits on when Keith Olbermann can next lead a TV show and when he can give interviews about the decision.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/22/olbermanns-msnbc-exit-was-weeks-in-the-making/', 'snippet': 'The separation agreement includes limits on when Keith Olbermann can next lead a TV show and when he can give interviews about the decision.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Thursday, NBC’s news division staged an elaborate presentation for advertisers, seeking to sell commercial time in NBC’s news programs over the next year. All the members of MSNBC’s prime-time lineup spoke at the lunch with one exception: Keith Olbermann, the network’s biggest star.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Olbermann’s MSNBC Exit Was Weeks in the Making', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cable Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suspensions, Dismissals and Resignations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olbermann, Keith', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Comcast Corp', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MSNBC', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBC Universal', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-22T19:48:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_mat