tinian and Israeli demands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/23/world/middleeast/23boundary.html', 'snippet': 'A scholar says he is trying to “demystify” the territorial hurdles that divide Israelis and Palestinians, and to debunk the notion that there is no way to reconcile the Palestinian and Israeli demands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON \x97 It speaks to the paralysis in the Middle East peace process that the most noteworthy development of the past week came when a mild-mannered analyst at a pro-Israel think tank unfurled three color-coded maps.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/world/23boundary-span/23boundary-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 355, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/23/world/23boundary-span/23boundary-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 355}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/world/23boundary-span/23BOUNDARY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/23/world/23boundary-span/23boundary-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/23/world/23boundary-span/23boundary-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trying to Break Logjam, Scholar Floats an Idea for a Palestinian Map', 'kicker': 'Diplomatic Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trying to Break Logjam, Scholar Floats an Idea for a Palestinian Map', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'va