ptix, an American oncology laboratory, for $470 million in cash.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/01/24/novartis-buys-u-s-cancer-lab-for-470-million/', 'snippet': 'Novartis says it has agreed to buy Genoptix, an American oncology laboratory, for $470 million in cash.', 'lead_paragraph': '7:45 a.m. | Updated Novartis, the Swiss pharmaceutical giant, said on Monday that it had agreed to buy Genoptix, an American oncology laboratory, for $470 million in cash.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Novartis Buys U.S. Cancer Lab for $470 Million', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ALCON INC', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Novartis AG', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-24T09:47:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris V. Nicholson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': 'V.', 'lastname': 'Nicholson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/a68f6a34-8046-5c3f-ab20-117ba11f05e1', 'word_count': 200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a68f6a34-8046-5c3f-ab20-117ba11f05e1'}, {'abstract': 'Diego Levy turned a series of car accidents on the street of Buenos Aires into sculptural photographs, Teresa Tomassoni and Isabel Castro report.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/24/mayhem-as-sculpture-in-buenos-aires/', 'snippet': 'Diego Levy turned a series of car accidents on the street of Buenos Aires into sculptural photographs, Teresa Tomassoni and Isabel Castro report.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Precautionary public service messages are often so gruesome or ham-fisted that the public tunes out the message. Diego Levy, 37, an Argentine photographer, was trying to pier