/curtain-down-heads-up-readers-on-rock-stars-and-leonard-bernstein/', 'snippet': 'A roundup of readers’ responses to recent posts about rock stars on Broadway and Leonard Bernstein’s status as one of the greatest composers of all time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Do rock stars belong on Broadway? That’s the question Charles Isherwood asked in his Theater Talkback post last week, and readers were divided on the answer. Another topic that generated discussion was whether or not Leonard Bernstein should be included in a list of the Top 10 composers of all time. Following is a roundup of what readers had to say about these questions, culled from responses on the ArtsBeat blog and The New York Times’s theater coverage on Facebook and Twitter. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Curtain Down, Heads Up: Readers on Rock Stars and Leonard Bernstein', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-24T16:00:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/862a06f8-68e5-5c97-ae21-18ecf057ad48', 'word_count': 690, 'uri': 'nyt://article/862a06f8-68e5-5c97-ae21-18ecf057ad48'}, {'abstract': 'The Asian Cup in Qatar is now down to the final four — Australia, Japan, South Korea and Uzbekistan. The semifinals will be played Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/24/asian-cup-down-to-the-final-four/', 'snippet': 'The Asian Cup in Qatar is now down to the final four — Australia, Japan, South Korea and Uzbekistan. The semifinals will be played Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DOHA, Qatar — The Asian Cup is down to a classic final four —