'George Allen, who lost his Senate seat in 2006, now seeks to recapture it from Senator Jim Webb of Virginia.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/24/george-allen-seeking-to-recapture-virginia-senate-seat/', 'snippet': 'George Allen, who lost his Senate seat in 2006, now seeks to recapture it from Senator Jim Webb of Virginia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the morning of Aug. 14, 2006, Senator George Allen of Virginia was expecting to easily defeat his Democratic challenger, Jim Webb, for re-election and had his eye planted firmly on the 2008 Republican presidential nomination.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'George Allen Seeks to Recapture Virginia Senate Seat', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-24T17:44:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b852a3c-3d63-541c-b9b5-c6d18afc89e4', 'word_count': 652, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b852a3c-3d63-541c-b9b5-c6d18afc89e4'}, {'abstract': 'Saying no to a feeding tube can feel tantamount to allowing a loved one to starve.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/24/when-they-cannot-eat/', 'snippet': 'Saying no to a feeding tube can feel tantamount to allowing a loved one to starve.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jean Minarick has had a tough few weeks, grappling with one of the crossroads decisions that family members so often shoulder for ailing elders. “I’ve been a wreck,” she said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When They Cannot Eat', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': 