ob, Wally Backman was promoted two levels from the short-season Brooklyn Cyclones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Mets passed over Wally Backman as their major league manager this off-season, hiring Terry Collins instead. But Backman was a finalist for the job and remains on track to possibly manage in Flushing someday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Backman to Manage Mets’ Class AA Team', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Backman, Wally', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T00:58:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e539464-5b46-56ae-bc33-5e2a02c8b985', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e539464-5b46-56ae-bc33-5e2a02c8b985'}, {'abstract': 'As President Obama prepares to tackle the economy in his State of the Union address Tuesday, economists and industry executives are sifting through the data.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/25/business/economy/25econ.html', 'snippet': 'As President Obama prepares to tackle the economy in his State of the Union address Tuesday, economists and industry executives are sifting through the data.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year ago, the economy looked as if it were speeding down the runway, only to stall out in the spring.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/25/business/25ECON/25E