icle/692c1786-0c9f-5471-a1fe-f4f65eac2ca2'}, {'abstract': 'What will get you blocked.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/24/comment-reminder/', 'snippet': 'What will get you blocked.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just a few things: obscenities, even mild ones, are not allowed; and if I see a clear falsehood, such as a stark misrepresentation of something I or someone else wrote, I will block it. Some things will slip through; those don’t count as precedents.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Comment Reminder', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T01:15:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/0380b3a7-cd17-5a3a-9c67-b6b8f277b041', 'word_count': 44, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0380b3a7-cd17-5a3a-9c67-b6b8f277b041'}, {'abstract': 'During Fox’s broadcast, the analyst Troy Aikman said he assumed if a player wasn’t playing, then he can’t play.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/25/sports/football/25nfl.html', 'snippet': 'During Fox’s broadcast, the analyst Troy Aikman said he assumed if a player wasn’t playing, then he can’t play.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the leading story lines in Green Bay’s 21-14 win over the Bears in the N.F.C. championship game Sunday was Chicago quarterback Jay Cutler’s knee injury. Cutler said he could not pinpoint the late second-quarter play on which he was hurt, yet after he went to the sideline, Fox’s camera often showed him standing.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When Talking Toughness, Aikman Believes in Cutler', 'kicker': 'N.F.L. Roundup', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When Talking Toughness, Aikman Believes in Cutler', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AGUILERA, CHRISTINA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Bears', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cutler, Jay', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T01:16:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cff620e9-eb7c-5b30-8d3c-fd6457cc012c', 'word_count': 821, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cff620e9-eb7c-5b30-8d3c-fd6457cc012c'}, {'abstract': 'Turkey released details of its own report into the bloody seizure a ship bound for Gaza, a day after Israel published findings that reignited a bitter dispute between the nations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/25/world/europe/25turkey.html', 'snippet': 'Turkey released details of its own report into the bloody seizure a ship bound for Gaza, a day after Israel published findings that reignited a bitter dispute between the nations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISTANBUL — Turkey released details on Monday of its own report about the seizure last year of a Turkish aid ship bound for Gaza by Israeli commandos. The government contended that two of the activists who were killed on the ship had been shot by Israeli forces from a helicopter before the commandos landed on