rokerage firm to a diversified global investment bank.', 'lead_paragraph': 'William A. Schreyer, a former chief of Merrill Lynch who led the big brokerage house into the age of global financial markets, died on Saturday at his home in Princeton, N.J. He was 83.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/25/business/SCHREYER-obit/SCHREYER-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/25/business/SCHREYER-obit/SCHREYER-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/25/business/SCHREYER-obit/SCHREYER-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'William Schreyer, 83, Merrill Chief, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'William Schreyer, 83, Merrill Chief, Dies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Merrill Lynch & Co', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schreyer, William A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T01:44:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Williams Walsh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': 'Williams', 'lastname': 'Walsh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/60c43652-cbcd-52c2-a036-ebea5a438de3', 'word_count': 771, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60c43652-cbcd-52c2-a036-ebea5a438de3'}, {'abstract': 'The idea that an individual has power over his health has a long history in American popular culture, but there is no link between optimism and health.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/25/opinion/25sloan.html', 'snippet': 'The idea that an individual has power over his health has a long history in American popular culture, but there is no link between optimism and health.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GABRIELLE GIFFORDS’S remarkable recovery from a bullet to her head has provided a heartening respite from a national calamity. Representative Giffords’s husband describes her as a “fighter,” and no doubt she is one. Whether her recovery has anything to do with a fighting spirit, however, is another matter entirely.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Fighting Spirit Won’t Save Your Life', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Fighting Spirit Won’t Save Your Life', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychology and Psychologists', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Giffords, Gabrielle', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T01:46:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard P. Sloan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': 'P.', 'lastname': 'Sloan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/1192d986-41aa-5be6-83a7-e3af123d4150', 'word_count': 780, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1192d986-41aa-5be6-83a7-e3af123d4150'}, {'abstract': 'In a bid to maintain civility, the Penney’s board will add William A. Ackman and Steven Roth, two activist investors who hold a 27 percent stake in the retailer.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/01/24/2-big-investors-get-their-say-at-j-c-penney/', 'snippet': 'In a bid to maintain civility, the Penney’s board will add William A. Ackman and Steven Roth, two activist investors who hold a 27 percent stake in the retailer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hedge fund manager William A. Ackman has placed a big bet on J.C. Penney. Now it appears that the retailer will let him have a say in how to fix it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2 Big Investors Get Their Say at J.C. Penney', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boards of Directors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ackman, William A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roth, Steven', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Penney, J C, Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pershing Square Capital Management', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vornado Realty Trust', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T01:51:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/569b4145-cc7e-522b-8559-930a9add8acc', 'word_count': 625, 'uri': 'nyt://article/569b4145-cc7e-522b-8559-930a9add8acc'}, {'abstract': 'More carmakers, in a sign that the economy is recovering, are buying commercial time for ads that will run during the big game on Feb. 6.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/25/business/media/25adco.html', 'snippet': 'More carmakers, in a sign that the economy is recovering, are buying commercial time for ads that will run during the big game on Feb. 6.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE two teams that will play in Super Bowl XLV on Feb. 6 are the Packers and the Steelers. But perhaps for a day they ought to be renamed the Porsches and the Siennas or even, given their old-school roots, the Packards and the Studebakers.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/25/business/adcosub/adcosub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/25/business/adcosub/adcosub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/25/business/adcosub/adcosub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/25/business/adcosub/adcosub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/25/business/adcosub/adcosub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Super Bowl Comeback on Wheels Signals Optimism', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Super Bowl Comeback on Wheels Signals Optimism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mercedes-Benz', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kia Motors Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERT