f information can’t be hidden behind the state-secrets privilege.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/25/opinion/25tue2.html', 'snippet': 'The Supreme Court should honor the gravity of real state secrets by assuring that other kinds of information can’t be hidden behind the state-secrets privilege.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the Supreme Court last week, Justice Antonin Scalia summed up what he and other justices seemed to consider the least bad outcome in a difficult case: “It seems to me you call the game off.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tactical Secrets', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tactical Secrets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Dynamics Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T03:53:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1c444e3-a843-5eec-ae8a-a197936bb585', 'word_count': 556, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1c444e3-a843-5eec-ae8a-a197936bb585'}, {'abstract': 'Amgen will pay $425 million and perhaps $575 million in milestone payments to BioVex, a maker of experimental cancer drugs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/25/business/25amgen.html', 'snippet': 'Amgen will pay $425 million and perhaps $575 million in milestone payments to BioVex, a maker of experimental cancer drugs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amgen said it agreed to buy BioVex, a closely held maker of experimental cancer drugs, for $425 million and a