ks live on television.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tea Party Response to Air Live on CNN', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State of the Union Message (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachmann, Michele M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Paul D Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cable News Network', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T21:10:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/b083801a-608b-528f-b57b-ad7ea33852e9', 'word_count': 349, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b083801a-608b-528f-b57b-ad7ea33852e9'}, {'abstract': '“Strongman,” Zachary Levy’s lump-in-the-throat portrait of an aging muscleman, is an outsider tale of unforced rawness and lilting poignancy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/movies/26strong.html', 'snippet': '“Strongman,” Zachary Levy’s lump-in-the-throat portrait of an aging muscleman, is an outsider tale of unforced rawness and lilting poignancy.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Strongman,” Zachary Levy’s lump-in-the-throat portrait of an aging muscleman, is an outsider tale of unforced rawness and lilting poignancy. Not that Stanley Pleskun, a k a Stanless Steel, is in any way clapped out: he can hoist 10,000-pound trucks with his legs and three adults with a single finger. It’s the emotional heavy lifting that does him in.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/26/arts/STRONG/STRONG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/26/arts/STRONG/STRONG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/26/arts/STRONG/STRONG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 573, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/26/arts/STRONG/STRONG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/26/arts/STRONG/STRONG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Iron Man’s Life of Might-Have-Beens', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Strongman'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Iron Man’s Life of Might-Have-Beens', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T21:17:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeannette Catsoulis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeannette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Catsoulis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3f31227-e1e7-55e5-972f-e6fcab43bae0', 'word_count': 349, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3f31227-e1e7-55e5-972f-e6fcab43bae0'}, {'abstract': 'The World Economic Forum is about to begin in Davos, Switzerland. DealBook’s Andrew Ross 