mission’s nearly two-year examination lays blame on two presidential administrations, an alphabet soup of regulatory agencies and big players on Wall Street, The New York Times says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The panel appointed by Congress to investigate the causes and consequences of the financial crisis has found that there plenty of blame to go around, The New York Times’s Sewell Chan reports. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Financial Crisis ‘Avoidable,’ Inquiry Panel Concludes', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Financial Crisis Inquiry Commission', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-25T22:20:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/b8ec4e3e-2473-569b-8e3e-60564a539edc', 'word_count': 219, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8ec4e3e-2473-569b-8e3e-60564a539edc'}, {'abstract': 'Behind the scenes of the video game, Halo 3, by Bungie Studios.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2007/09/26/technology/circuits/20070927_HALO_SLIDESHOW_index.html', 'snippet': 'Behind the scenes of the video game, Halo 3, by Bungie Studios.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Behind the scenes of the video game, Halo 3, by Bungie Studios.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2007/09/26/technology/circuits/halo.75.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/