e Union watching party in Nevada.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RENO, Nev. — Here in Harry Reid’s Nevada, President Obama’s speech was greeted with avid applause and a last-moment standing ovation by a partisan crowd who said they were sick of the tenor of legislating some 2,275 miles to the east.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Watching the State of the Union in Reno', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State of the Union Message (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Reno (Nev)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T05:34:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse McKinley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/38ff145d-8873-59d4-b260-973cfd5619b4', 'word_count': 812, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38ff145d-8873-59d4-b260-973cfd5619b4'}, {'abstract': 'Images from President Obama’s 2011 address to Congress and the nation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/01/25/us/20110126_SOTU.html', 'snippet': 'Images from President Obama’s 2011 address to Congress and the nation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Images from President Obama’s 2011 address to Congress and the nation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/25/us/20110126_SOTU-slide-0BFG/20110126_SOTU-slide-0BFG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/25/us/20