ope-toils-on-debt-u-s-and-japan-watch-nervously/', 'snippet': 'After bailouts in Greece and Ireland, the once-unthinkable is becoming more probable and investors are scrutinizing nearly every country with high debt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAVOS, Switzerland — The fiscal crisis in Europe may be only the beginning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Europe Toils on Debt, U.S. and Japan Watch Nervously', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stiglitz, Joseph E', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Economic Forum', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T10:23:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liz Alderman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alderman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/9dce84f9-5cef-5114-bea3-4adb08db8b6b', 'word_count': 1240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9dce84f9-5cef-5114-bea3-4adb08db8b6b'}, {'abstract': 'The Chinese Prime Minister Wen Jiabao appeared at the nation’s top petition bureau in Beijing, where ordinary people go to file grievances.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/27/world/asia/27china.html', 'snippet': 'The Chinese Prime Minister Wen Jiabao appeared at the nation’s top petition bureau in Beijing, where ordinary people go to file grievances.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SHANGHAI \x97 Prime Minister Wen Jiabao is known for his populist approach and near constant presence in Chinese headlines. He often races to the scene of natural disasters to comfort survivors. On state-run television, he can be seen eating with the poor in rural villages. Though often stage-managed by Chinese news media, his common touch has earned him the nickname “Grandpa Wen.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China Leader Encourages Criticism of Government', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chinese Are Encouraged to Criticize Government, by the Premier', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wen Jiabao', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T10:40:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Barboza', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barboza', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a1c796f-abfb-5757-9eec-0d510a650816', 'word_count': 648, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a1c796f-abfb-5757-9eec-0d510a650816'}, {'abstract': 'After the first day of Senior Bowl practices, the Oklahoma running back discussed the craft of playing running back.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/q-and-a-with-running-back-demarco-murray/', 'snippet': 'After the first day of Senior Bowl practices, the Oklahoma running back discussed the craft of playing running back.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DeMarco Murray burst onto the national scene his freshman year at the University of Oklahoma with his big-play athleticism. Although a torn hamstring as a sophomore and minor injuries as a junior forced Murray to miss six games as well as a chance to play in the B.C.S. title game, he still ranks sixth in career yardage among Oklahoma runners and he owns the school’s all-purpose yards record. Murray sat down with the Footballguys.com staff writer Matt Waldman after the first day of Senior Bowl practices this week to talk about the craft of playing running back. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q. and A. With Running Back DeMarco Murray', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Oklahoma', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T10:45:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Waldman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/858e3608-58e8-59f2-be77-ff66e478da14', 'word_count': 1149, 'uri': 'nyt://article/858e3608-58e8-59f2-be77-ff66e478da14'}, {'abstract': 'The Senior Bowl is a great networking opportunity to become an N.F.L. assistant coach or scout.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/senior-bowl-day-2-new-beginnings-and-reunions/', 'snippet': 'The Senior Bowl is a great networking opportunity to become an N.F.L. assistant coach or scout.', 'lead_paragraph': ' ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Senior Bowl, Day 2: New Beginnings and Reunions', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft an