lems in Outlook 2007 Reminders.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/q-a-finding-missing-outlook-reminders/', 'snippet': 'Fixing problems in Outlook 2007 Reminders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q.&A.: Finding Missing Outlook Reminders', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Software', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T12:30:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J.d. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b1856c5-8014-5c7e-9e09-c982d821a2c1', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b1856c5-8014-5c7e-9e09-c982d821a2c1'}, {'abstract': 'The state’s air resources board backpedaled on an initial plan to announce its standards in March, ahead of the E.P.A. and N.H.T.S.A.’s September timetable.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/california-federal-agencies-agree-on-emissions-standards-announcement-date/', 'snippet': 'The state’s air resources board backpedaled on an initial plan to announce its standards in March, ahead of the E.P.A. and N.H.T.S.A.’s September timetable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Environmental Protection Agency, the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration and the California Air Resources Board — the three agencies with primary responsibility for setting the next round of standards on fuel economy and greenhouse gas emissions for cars and light-duty trucks — have agreed to announce their proposals for 2017-25 model-year vehicles by Sept. 1, 2011, according to an E.P.A. press release issued on Monday.', '