d Senate hearings and urge Congress to strengthen oversight of offshore drilling operations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The chairmen of the presidential commission on the Deepwater Horizon explosion and oil spill will be on Capitol Hill today to present their findings and recommendations to the Senate Environment and Natural Resources Committee and the House Natural Resources Committee.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spill on the Hill', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Offshore Drilling and Exploration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bingaman, Jeff', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Graham, Bob', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reilly, William K', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gulf of Mexico', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T14:53:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By John M. Broder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/42692112-d6cc-5118-a39b-03fff11030e1', 'word_count': 288, 'uri': 'nyt://article/42692112-d6cc-5118-a39b-03fff11030e1'}, {'abstract': 'The Carlyle Group has teamed with the management of AlpInvest Partners to buy the firm from two pension fund managers, APG and PGGM.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/carlyle-to-buy-dutch-asset-manager-in-joint-venture/', 'snippet': 'The Carlyle Group has teamed with the management of AlpInvest Partners to buy the firm from two pension fund managers, APG and PGGM.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Carlyle Group has teamed with the management of AlpInvest Partners to buy the firm from two Dutch pension fund managers, the companies said in a joint statement on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Carlyle in Joint Venture to Buy Dutch Asset Manager', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carlyle Group', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pggm', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T15:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris V. Nicholson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': 'V.', 'lastname': 'Nicholson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/585f4d8e-a882-5ac5-b7af-f3e1561c774e', 'word_count': 221, 'uri': 'nyt://article/585f4d8e-a882-5ac5-b7af-f3e1561c774e'}, {'abstract': 'Term used among British Conservative Members of Parliament to characterise Prime Minister David Cameron’s public school put-downs. (Also, Flashmanned)', 'web_url': 'https://schott.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/to-flashman/', 'snippet': 'Term used among British Conservative Members of Parliament to characterise Prime Minister David Cameron’s public school put-downs. (Also, Flashmanned)', 'lead_paragraph': 'Term used among British Conservative Members of Parliament to characterise Prime Minister David Cameron’s public school put-downs.  (Also, Flashmanned)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'To Flashman', 'kicker': 'Schott&#039;s Vocab', 'con