 a row, which saves us from the ridiculous debate over that accomplishment compared to a real Grand Slam, accomplished in one calendar year, but his departure from the Australian Open on Wednesday gave tennis something else altogether: a touch of nobility.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nadal Is Noble in Defeat', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nadal Is Noble in Defeat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadal, Rafael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferrer, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T17:05:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fd70e3c-1956-5de5-9540-4bb99e0ebd34', 'word_count': 551, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0fd70e3c-1956-5de5-9540-4bb99e0ebd34'}, {'abstract': 'The teenage victims were forced to advertise sexual services on Craigslist, according to prosecutors.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/two-indicted-for-pimping-girls-on-craigslist/', 'snippet': 'The teenage victims were forced to advertise sexual services on Craigslist, according to prosecutors.', 'lead_paragraph': '6:44 p.m. | Updated Two men have been indicted for forcing at least two teenage girls to become prostitutes and to advertise their services on Craigslist, the Brooklyn district attorney, Charles J. Hynes, announced Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Charged With Pimping Girls on Craigslist', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kic