 artisans and good food.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/powder-trip-alta-wyoming/', 'snippet': 'A ski area that lacks the high-wattage lodging of its famous neighbor, Jackson Hole, makes up for it with its untracked snow, local artisans and good food.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alta, Wyo., near the Idaho border, is home to the Grand Targhee ski resort, just about an hour from its more famous neighbor, Jackson Hole. The distinction between the two resorts is a bit like the Montauk and Hamptons divide —\xa0Targhee is more rustic and lacks the high-wattage lodging of Jackson Hole. While the Four Seasons and the Amangani are both in Jackson, the most deluxe sleeping option near Targhee is the Teton Springs Resort (877-787-8757, 10 Warm Creak Lane) in Victor, Idaho.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Powder Trip | Alta, Wyo.', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T18:39:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Deal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Deal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/fdb7c66a-d665-5cd4-9c3d-5309fcf9950d', 'word_count': 384, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fdb7c66a-d665-5cd4-9c3d-5309fcf9950d'}, {'abstract': 'Many investment advisers would have to turn over private data, a move Washington hopes will help identify systemic dangers to the economy.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/regulators-move-to-boost-oversight-of-hedge-funds/', 'snippet': 'Many investment advisers would have to turn over private data, a move Washington hopes will help identify systemic dangers to the economy.', 'lead_paragraph': '6:34 p.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The