5eb'}, {'abstract': 'He returns to his roots as his Village restaurant doesn’t work out.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/26/brian-bistrong-closes-braeburn-and-returns-to-bouley/', 'snippet': 'He returns to his roots as his Village restaurant doesn’t work out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brian Bistrong, who, as Eater reported, closed his restaurant Braeburn  in Greenwich Village over the weekend, says he has gone back to working with David Bouley. He had worked with Mr. Bouley for seven years before taking jobs at the Harrison and elsewhere, and then opening Braeburn. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brian Bistrong Closes Braeburn and Returns to Bouley', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T23:11:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab4691d9-7b28-5348-a468-cd65f820b6eb', 'word_count': 112, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab4691d9-7b28-5348-a468-cd65f820b6eb'}, {'abstract': 'Versatile long-sleeve styles; hidden in an alley on the Bowery, Extra offers chinos, blankets and even a vintage rain parka; and other items.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/01/27/fashion/20110127-browsing.html', 'snippet': 'Versatile long-sleeve styles; hidden in an alley on the Bowery, Extra offers chinos, blankets and even a vintage rain parka; and other items.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Versatile long-sleeve styles; hidden in an alley on the Bowery, Extra offers chinos, blankets and even a vintage rain parka; and other items.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank