 a photograph by Christian Jaillite.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/27/garden/27kids.html', 'snippet': 'A child’s favorite blanket or toy can live on in a photograph by Christian Jaillite.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Christian Jaillite, the managing director of Elizabeth Eakins, a rug and fabric company, explained how a 45-by-60-inch photo of a much loved stuffed toy came to hang in his suburban New York dining room, above: “Most kids have a blanket or toy that they attach themselves to,” he said. “For my son, Hippo is it. I thought that one day we may want to remember Hippo, so I decided to photograph it.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27kids-span/27kids-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27kids-span/27kids-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27kids-span/Currents-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 628, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27kids-span/27kids-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27kids-span/27kids-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos That Preserve Beloved Objects', 'kicker': 'Currents | Kids', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Place on the Wall for Linus’s Blanket', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 