 company, which was started in 1963, had been bought by an investor group and given a stay of execution, “saving” its 250 employees, according to the new owner, the Americas Retail Flagship Fund.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27qa-span/27qa-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27qa-span/27qa-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27qa-span/QA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27qa-span/27qa-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/27/garden/27qa-span/27qa-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Julio Lizarazo, General Manager of the Gracious Home Flagship', 'kicker': 'Currents | Q&A', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gracious Home: Keeping the Upper East Side Supplied With Lint Rollers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-26T23:24:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Penelope Green', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Penelope', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Green', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reporte