 technology.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/27/us/politics/27obama.html', 'snippet': 'Illustrating a message from the State of the Union address at a plant that makes solar power and other energy-efficient technology.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANITOWOC, Wis. \x97 President Obama loves sports metaphors, and they were flying on Wednesday when he came to Green Bay Packers country to tour three factories and expand on the “winning the future” theme of his State of the Union address the night before.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/27/us/OBAMA/OBAMA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/27/us/OBAMA/OBAMA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/27/us/OBAMA/OBAMA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/27/us/OBAMA/OBAMA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/27/us/OBAMA/OBAMA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama, in Wisconsin, Picks Up Address’s Refrain', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama, in Wisconsin, Picks Up Address’s Refrain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State of the Union Message (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wisconsin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '