re an unpopular step of raising taxes for industries like biotech.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/28/us/politics/28tax.html', 'snippet': 'A popular step of lowering taxes for industries like trucking would require an unpopular step of raising taxes for industries like biotech.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON \x97 Large trucking companies paid the government more than 30 percent of their income in 2009. Biotechnology companies paid less than 5 percent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corporate Tax Code Proves Hard to Change', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corporate Tax Code Is Resistant to Change', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corporations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-27T13:17:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/872f6b55-4539-5609-8bdf-cecafdc9963b', 'word_count': 1038, 'uri': 'nyt://article/872f6b55-4539-5609-8bdf-cecafdc9963b'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the DealBook newsletter.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/01/27/morning-take-out-170/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the DealBook newsletter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MERGERS & ACQUISITIONS', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Take-Out', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Dive