e, Mark Salter, has been named as the author by The New York Post, Mark Halperin of Time magazine and early readers of the novel, who say it bears some of his telltale marks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/28/books/28salter.html', 'snippet': 'The former aide, Mark Salter, has been named as the author by The New York Post, Mark Halperin of Time magazine and early readers of the novel, who say it bears some of his telltale marks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1996, it took six months, one enterprising professor and an independent handwriting analysis to nail down the journalist Joe Klein as the anonymous author of “Primary Colors.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/28/us/salter/salter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 588, 'width': 353, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/28/us/salter/salter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/28/us/salter/salter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'McCain Ex-Aide Suspected as Anonymous ‘O’ Author', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'McCain Ex-Aide Suspected As Anonymous ‘O’ Author', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2008', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salter, Mark', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'O