omachs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/28/nyregion/28mansion.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo is hoping to soften the hearts of lawmakers by filling their stomachs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY \x97 On the menu for the Assembly speaker, Sheldon Silver, and the State Senate majority leader, Dean G. Skelos, was a tossed salad, chicken and a sober conversation about the state’s grim financial prognosis. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/28/nyregion/MANSION/MANSION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/28/nyregion/MANSION/MANSION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/28/nyregion/MANSION/MANSION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Governor Works to Build Rapport at Home', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Over Food and Drinks at Home, Governor Works to Build Rapport', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-28T01:19:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': No