65, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ae23524-b148-54db-ae65-d269fe3ba656'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Velella, a former Republican state senator, was a formidable figure in Albany until he pleaded guilty to bribery conspiracy seven years ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/28/nyregion/28velella.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Velella, a former Republican state senator, was a formidable figure in Albany until he pleaded guilty to bribery conspiracy seven years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Guy J. Velella, a former Republican state senator from the Bronx and a formidable figure in Albany until he pleaded guilty to bribery conspiracy seven years ago, died on Thursday in the Bronx. He was 66 and lived there, in the Morris Park section.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/28/nyregion/VELELLA-obit/VELELLA-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 970, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/28/nyregion/VELELLA-obit/VELELLA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/28/nyregion/VELELLA-obit/VELELLA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Guy J. Velella, State Senator From Bronx, Dies at 66', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Guy J. Velella, 66, a Force In Albany Until a Bribe Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Velella, Guy J', 'rank': 4, 'major':