ring practice in 2009.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ASPEN, Colo. — On a cold and sunny morning, Kevin Pearce stood at the bottom of the massive halfpipe at Buttermilk Mountain wearing a grin and black-framed glasses with thick lenses as his friends and former competitors practiced their runs for the Winter X Games. Riders kept zipping up the wall of the 22-foot pipe Thursday and launching into a bright, blue sky, working their way toward Pearce.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/28/sports/XGAMES2/XGAMES2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 881, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/28/sports/XGAMES2/XGAMES2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/28/sports/XGAMES2/XGAMES2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Still Healing, but Back at X Games as Spectator', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Still Healing, but Back as a Spectator', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pearce, Kevin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snowboarding', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'X Games', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Aspen (Colo)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-28T03:36:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Higgins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastna