s for the Wolf Conservation Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEDFORD, N.Y. — Though it was billed as a joint recital, they never appeared together. Atka took the stage first, sweeping right to the piano and striking a commanding pose. But with the keys covered and the lid down, there wasn’t much else he could do. He being a wolf.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Howls, But Many High Notes at Hélène Grimaud’s Performance for Wolves', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wolves', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grimaud, Helene', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wolf Conservation Center', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-28T16:17:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James R. Oestreich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Oestreich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5a2714f-cc08-553c-adb0-579c2651f707', 'word_count': 550, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5a2714f-cc08-553c-adb0-579c2651f707'}, {'abstract': 'Phoenix Suns Owner Robert Sarver doesn’t intend on trading veteran guard Steve Nash, despite rampant speculation.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/28/suns-owner-doesnt-foresee-nash-trade/', 'snippet': 'Phoenix Suns Owner Robert Sarver doesn’t intend on trading veteran guard Steve Nash, despite rampant speculation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.B.A. trade deadline looms near, so it’s natural to start wondering what some teams will be doing with their veteran players. Attention is being paid to the Phoenix Suns (20-24 through Thursday), focusing on the fate of the veteran guard Steve Nash.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Suns Owner Doesn’t Foresee Nash Trade', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nash, Steve', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Phoenix Suns', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-28T16:19:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanne C. Gerstner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanne', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Gerstner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/04cdaea1-ee64-5098-b63c-4698640c4c88', 'word_count': 250, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04cdaea1-ee64-5098-b63c-4698640c4c88'}, {'abstract': 'That it took until Thursday to figure out Jeff Fisher wasn’t returning as coach of the Titans was a debacle even by Bud Adams’s standards.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/29/sports/29leading.html', 'snippet': 'That it took until Thursday to figure out Jeff Fisher wasn’t returning as coach of the Titans was a debacle even by Bud Adams’s standards.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So much of sports success is all about timing and although we long knew that the Titans owner Bud Adams was challenged in that regard (his hair being from the Pleistocene Era and all), that it took until yesterday to figure out Jeff Fisher wasn’t returning as coach was a debacle even by Adams’s standards. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/29/sports/29leading1/29leading1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 857, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit