ce of the central London party zone as a culinary destination.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/30/travel/30bites-gauthier-soho.html', 'snippet': 'Gauthier Soho, which opened in May and was recently awarded a Michelin star, adds momentum to the emergence of the central London party zone as a culinary destination.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gastronomy just might be the strongest modern link in the entente cordiale between France and England. The English remain avid fans of French cooking, and France repays the compliment by supplying them with a continuously renewed brigade of culinary talent. By any measure, London has the most impressive constellation of French chefs of any European city outside of France.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/world/30BITES/30BITES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/world/30BITES/30BITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/30/world/30BITES/30BITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Restaurant Review: Gauthier Soho in London', 'kicker': 'Bites', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'LONDON: Gauthier Soho', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-28T19:55:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexande