 technology and media banking, and said it would separate its energy and power banking team into two units, among other changes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Citigroup on Friday shuffled the organization of some of its investment banking groups, including by naming its top deal maker, Mark Shafir, as the new co-head of the technology, media and telecommunications group, according to an internal memorandum obtained by DealBook.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Citi Shuffles Its Tech, Energy and Chemicals Banking Groups', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shafir, Mark', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citigroup Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-28T21:12:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e84d567-a523-5f1a-9601-55a00d1f0163', 'word_count': 644, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e84d567-a523-5f1a-9601-55a00d1f0163'}, {'abstract': 'Vice President Joe Biden says that the Egyptian president is not a dictator. Bloggers disagree.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/28/how-do-you-solve-a-problem-like-mubarak/', 'snippet': 'Vice President Joe Biden says that the Egyptian president is not a dictator. Bloggers disagree.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UPDATED BELOW, 11:50 a.m. Saturday:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Do You Solve a Problem Like Mubarak?', 'kicker': 'The Thread', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject