 homonym or shape represent the holiday’s good wishes: for happiness, prosperity and wealth.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Year’s Treats', 'kicker': 'Quick Bite | Chinese Markets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Year’s Treats', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New Year', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-28T22:50:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By M. H. Reed', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cbb695c0-02e5-5bfa-8aef-cbf3f814efac', 'word_count': 317, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cbb695c0-02e5-5bfa-8aef-cbf3f814efac'}, {'abstract': 'The cuisine at Kraft Bistro has some Afghan dishes, but mostly suits the Western palate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/30/nyregion/30dinewe.html', 'snippet': 'The cuisine at Kraft Bistro has some Afghan dishes, but mostly suits the Western palate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RAFT BISTRO has lots of panache — sparkling chandeliers hanging from rustic beams, paper place mats replaced with every course, citrus slices in the water carafes, even a miniature winterscape decorating the dividers between the bar and dining areas. Like a piece of stage set by Cocteau, it is so lavish with candles, whitened twigs, white pin lights and shimmery crystals that patrons can easily forget its icy white counterpart outside.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/nyregi