blasted a plan recently posted on Representative Michelle Bachmann’s congressional Web site to cut federal spending by $400 billion.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/28/veterans-groups-criticize-bachmann-plan-to-cut-benefits/', 'snippet': 'Veterans groups blasted a plan recently posted on Representative Michelle Bachmann’s congressional Web site to cut federal spending by $400 billion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For years, federal spending on the military and veterans affairs seemed nearly as sacrosanct as Social Security. But with some House Republicans now talking about cutting the Pentagon budget, veterans groups have grown nervous that the Department of Veterans Affairs will be next. And so today, a number of groups took preemptive action, vigorously blasting a proposal for V.A. budget cuts that came from a Tea Party leader, Representative Michele Bachmann, Republican of Minnesota.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Veterans Groups Criticize Bachmann Plan to Cut Benefits', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachmann, Michele M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN LEGION', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans of Foreign Wars', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-28T23:27:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Dao', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dao', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/cfa22ee2-e8ee-5