reate their own games and share them with the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s someone out there on Sony’s PlayStation Network who goes by the name Urbandevill. I’ve never met him. (I assume it’s a he because the online avatar sports yellow eyes, green skin and a long, green beard). I don’t know what country he lives in. In fact, I don’t know anything about him.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/29/arts/sub-PLANET/sub-PLANET-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/29/arts/sub-PLANET/sub-PLANET-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/29/arts/sub-PLANET/sub-PLANET-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/29/arts/sub-PLANET/sub-PLANET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/29/arts/sub-PLANET/sub-PLANET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Allowing Players to Assume the Ultimate Role: Game Creators', 'kicker': 'Video Game Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Allowing Players to Assume The Ultimate Role: Game Creators', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sony Corporation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer and Video Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-28T23:48:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_