e.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/29/world/middleeast/29cairo.html', 'snippet': 'Hours of struggle for a bridge defined Friday’s events as people shed fears of the government, a few steps at a time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — The battle had gone on for hours on Friday, and the end of the bridge was in sight. Somewhere past the green armored cars and through the smoke was Liberation Square. For miles the protesters had marched peacefully, shouting at balconies for their neighbors to join them.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/29/world/29CAIRO1/29CAIRO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/29/world/29CAIRO1/29CAIRO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/29/world/29CAIRO1/29CAIRO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/29/world/29CAIRO1/29CAIRO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/29/world/29CAIRO1/29CAIRO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Egyptian Hopes Converged in Fight for Cairo Bridge', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hopes of Egyptians, Poor and Wealthy, Converge in Fight for Cairo Bridge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mubarak, Hosni', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'na