nicks.html', 'snippet': 'A loss had already been cemented when Shawne Williams, who is enjoying a comeback season with the Knicks, and Atlanta’s Marvin Williams started jawing at each other.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA \x97 Shawne Williams’s comeback is a Hollywood story, a resurrection as much as any in the Knicks’ return to relevancy. He was out of the league last season, his career derailed by a number of off-the-court issues, and he made the Knicks as the last player on the roster. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/29/sports/knicks/knicks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 922, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fight Adds to Knicks’ Frustration', 'kicker': 'Hawks 111, Knicks 102', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fight Adds to Knicks’ Frustration', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Shawne', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Hawks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Marvin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-29T04:10:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Abrams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abrams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8420a047-59de-52cb-a1a9-57067ba3f058', 'word_count': 689, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8420a047-59de-52cb-a1a9-57067ba3f058'}, {'abstract': 'Robert Wrigh