s.html', 'snippet': 'Shawn Ward says he and his twin, Shane, combined their complementary creative and business talents to form a shoe company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THERE are two sets of twins in my family. My own twin, Shane, is the creative director of our company. And we have a set of younger twin brothers, Eric and Derrick.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/business/BOSS/BOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 624, 'width': 483, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/business/BOSS/BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/30/business/BOSS/BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'I’m Lucky to Have a Twin', 'kicker': 'The Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'I’m Lucky to Have a Twin', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Twins', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-29T18:37:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shawn Ward', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shawn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ward', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2a9e71f-4922-5f9b-937b-abfa060a8774', 'word_count': 648, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2a9e71f-4922-5f9b-937b-abfa060a8774'}, {'abstract': 'Job postings show a rising demand for workers, though not for all industries or skill sets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nyt