 {'abstract': 'Signed by the Chicago Bulls last off-season as insurance, Kurt Thomas has flourished as a starter, and he is a big reason they were 16-6 through Friday without Joakim Noah.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/29/big-sexy-paying-big-dividends-for-the-bulls/', 'snippet': 'Signed by the Chicago Bulls last off-season as insurance, Kurt Thomas has flourished as a starter, and he is a big reason they were 16-6 through Friday without Joakim Noah.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kurt Thomas played in only five of the Chicago Bulls’ first 24 games and on many nights he was on the bench in a suit rather than on the floor in a uniform. Then on Dec. 15 Joakim Noah was injured and was expected to be out six to eight weeks with a torn ligament in his thumb. Suddenly, Thomas was \xa0starting at center.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Big Sexy Paying Big Dividends for the Bulls', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Noah, Joakim', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thomas, Kurt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Bulls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-29T20:30:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Fred Bierman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Fred', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bierman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0d93dc7-237d-5a2d-95d8-88723ce6245c', 'word_count': 311, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0d93dc7-237d-5a2d-95d8-88723ce6245c'}, {'abstract': 'When N.H.L. players chos