/d2d4fb8b-1e18-5d4f-a609-df55999d936f'}, {'abstract': 'Chirp Radio, a Chicago community radio project, recently celebrated its first birthday but still has no frequency and operates only on the Web.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/30/us/30cncchirp.html', 'snippet': 'Chirp Radio, a Chicago community radio project, recently celebrated its first birthday but still has no frequency and operates only on the Web.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Local Community Radio Act, signed into law this month by President Obama, would seem a fitting first birthday present for Chirp Radio, a Chicago community radio project, except that the law does not help groups hoping to be awarded frequencies in the country’s biggest radio markets.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After a Year, Chirp Radio Has Made Gains, but Is Still Awaiting Its Own Frequency', 'kicker': 'Chicago News Cooperative', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After a Year, Chirp Radio Has Made Gains, but Is Still Awaiting Its Own Frequency', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grants (Corporate and Foundation)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Telephones and Telecommunications', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-30T01:22:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Idalmy Carrera', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Idalmy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrera', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b7b7c95-9cd5-5ec7-a701-e6f4c813e906', 'word_count': 487, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b7b7c95-9cd5-5ec7-a701-e6f4c813e906'}, {'a