ixed backgrounds are rejecting color lines that have defined Americans for generations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/30/us/30mixed.html', 'snippet': 'Many young adults of mixed backgrounds are rejecting color lines that have defined Americans for generations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLLEGE PARK, Md. \x97 In another time or place, the game of “What Are You?” that was played one night last fall at the University of Maryland might have been mean, or menacing: Laura Wood’s peers were picking apart her every feature in an effort to guess her race.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/us/30mixed1_span/30mixed1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 250, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/30/us/30mixed1_span/30mixed1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 250}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/us/30mixed1_span/30mixed1_span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 250, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/us/30mixed1_span/30mixed1_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/30/us/30mixed1_span/30mixed1_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Black? White? Asian? More Young Americans Choose All of the Above', 'kicker': 'Race Remixed', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Black? White? Asian? More Young Americans Choose All of the Above', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Native Americans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N