es Warren', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Warren', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7206dd4-bc36-5d6e-aa93-4c4a573f14d8', 'word_count': 739, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7206dd4-bc36-5d6e-aa93-4c4a573f14d8'}, {'abstract': 'Thanks to a high-speed cigarette-rolling machine and a tax loophole, a new group of roll-your-own smokers have been created. And they’re paying $2.70 a pack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/30/us/30cncroll.html', 'snippet': 'Thanks to a high-speed cigarette-rolling machine and a tax loophole, a new group of roll-your-own smokers have been created. And they’re paying $2.70 a pack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The small group that gathered at lunchtime inside a strip-mall storefront in Skokie had not come to eat. They had come to Smokes & Such to admire the new $30,000 machine that spits out a carton of custom-made cigarettes in eight minutes flat \x97 at $27 a carton. That’s $2.70 a pack, or about a third of what smokers would pay at the CVS pharmacy across the street.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/us/30CNCROLL/30CNCROLL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/30/us/30CNCROLL/30CNCROLL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/us/30CNCROLL/30CNCROLL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/us/30CNCROLL/30CNCROLL-thumbStandard.jpg', '