f1440'}, {'abstract': 'The contemplative saxophonist Charles Lloyd led his New Quartet — with Jason Moran, Eric Harland and Reuben Rogers — at the Rose Theater on Saturday night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/31/arts/music/31jalc.html', 'snippet': 'The contemplative saxophonist Charles Lloyd led his New Quartet — with Jason Moran, Eric Harland and Reuben Rogers — at the Rose Theater on Saturday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Charles Lloyd’s name alone might sell tickets as a symbol of integrity and spiritual health and every-man-has-his-season. A saxophonist and bandleader, he was a friendly and popular face of post-Coltrane jazz in the 1960s. Then he retreated for much of the next two decades, and came out the other side an elegant older man with a stronger, softer art.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/31/arts/JALC/JALC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/01/31/arts/JALC/JALC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 349}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/31/arts/JALC/JALC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/31/arts/JALC/JALC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/31/arts/JALC/JALC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Slow and Roomy, With Space for Contemplation', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Slow and Roomy, With Space for Contemplation', 'name': None, '