o leave the country, reactions range from nervous to stoic. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/1248069599542/tourists-trapped-in-egypt.html', 'snippet': 'As thousands of foreign tourists and Egyptians try to leave the country, reactions range from nervous to stoic. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'As thousands of foreign tourists and Egyptians try to leave the country, reactions range from nervous to stoic. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/01/30/world/11151_1_cairo-americantourists_75x75.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/01/30/world/11151_1_cairo-americantourists_75x75.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tourists Trapped in Egypt', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mubarak, Hosni', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-31T00:17:54+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'Stephen Farrell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Farrell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/eb166b3e-1d34-5bdb-9a57-21f2ba363412', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/eb166b3e-1d34-5bdb-9a57-21f2ba363412'}, {'abstract': 'In the 140-pound junior welterweight division, Timothy Bradley is the last undefeated champion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/01/31/sports/31boxing.html', 'snippet': 'In the 140-pound junior welterweight division, Timothy Bradley is the last undefeated champion.', 'lead_para