}, {'abstract': 'This week the Leading Off column is aggregating  Super Bowl articles from the Web.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/31/leading-off-super-bowl-edition/', 'snippet': 'This week the Leading Off column is aggregating  Super Bowl articles from the Web.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We are kicking off Super Bowl week by anointing the Fifth Down blog as the unofficial headquarters of Super Bowl excess. And Leading Off: Super Bowl Edition will become your daily vortex of hype. Come and enjoy one-stop hyperbole shopping, with no shipping and handling! Consider us silliness central, overkill’s landing page.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leading Off: Super Bowl Edition', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Matthews, Clay III', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Polamalu, Troy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodgers, Aaron', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roethlisberger, Ben', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tomlin, Mike', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ward, Hines', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dallas Cowboys', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Green Bay Packers', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Steelers', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-31T16:12:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/211fed40-351e-5443-88dd-ec71f9ece0ba', 'word_count': 523, 'uri': 'nyt://article/211fed40-351e-5443-88dd-ec71f9ece0ba'}, {'abstract': 'A helium-filled balloon sends a box containing two video cameras and a G.P.S. tracker into the atmosphere; when it pops, a parachute returns it to earth.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/31/on-our-radar-british-students-film-earth-from-space/', 'snippet': 'A helium-filled balloon sends a box containing two video cameras and a G.P.S. tracker into the atmosphere; when it pops, a parachute returns it to earth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Using a weather balloon, a foam box, some duct tape, a video camera and a G.P.S. tracking device, two British students capture extraordinary images of Earth from the edge of space. The project cost about $560. [BBC]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Our Radar: British Students Film Earth from Space', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Camcorders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drilling and Boring', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drought', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Positioning System', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Edmund G Jr', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Baghdad (Iraq)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value':