p, lacks health insurance and needs money for a medical procedure.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/01/31/kool-herc-is-in-pain-and-using-it-to-put-focus-on-insurance/', 'snippet': 'Kool Herc, known as the Father of Hip-Hop, lacks health insurance and needs money for a medical procedure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Update, Feb. 2 | A medical relief fund has been set up for Kool Herc.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kool Herc Is in Pain, and Using It to Put Focus on Insurance', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-01-31T23:23:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gonzalez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gonzalez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/62f79b83-811f-5c02-b4d7-80fc496dde92', 'word_count': 578, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62f79b83-811f-5c02-b4d7-80fc496dde92'}, {'abstract': 'In Alexandria, some volunteers are organizing to focus on traffic, cleanup, protection and emergency response.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/02/01/world/middleeast/01alexandria.html', 'snippet': 'In Alexandria, some volunteers are organizing to focus on traffic, cleanup, protection and emergency response.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALEXANDRIA, Egypt \x97 At the first protest, on Jan. 25, Majd Mardini noticed that an ambulance could not get through the crowd of demonstrators. Outgoing, voluble and anything but shy, he began asking people to step aside, parting the crowd so the ambulance could get through.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/02/01/world/middleeast/01alexandriaPicA/01