4c', 'word_count': 637, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e46d0bae-f334-512c-9ca9-f06288c7944c'}, {'abstract': 'The violinist Jennifer Koh offered a concert of unaccompanied pieces at the 92nd Street Y on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/02/01/arts/music/01koh.html', 'snippet': 'The violinist Jennifer Koh offered a concert of unaccompanied pieces at the 92nd Street Y on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pianists and guitarists often give solo recitals, while singers and most other instrumentalists invariably perform with piano accompaniment. But the intrepid violinist Jennifer Koh took to the stage alone for her concert on Sunday afternoon at the 92nd Street Y.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/02/01/arts/KOH/KOH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 756, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/02/01/arts/KOH/KOH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/02/01/arts/KOH/KOH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Violinist Layers Bach With Relative Newcomers', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Violinist Layers Bach With Relative Newcomers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ninety-Second Street Y', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Koh, Jennifer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-01-31T23:34:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivien Schweitzer',